{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SJdYEJozMptnnPV7GvdnHf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B 无约束基线\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents 事件抽取 Qwen3-8B 无约束 baseline，246 docs 全量，建立 EE violation landscape\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n7\t      \"EV_pct\": 24.0,\n8\t      \"RoV_pct\": 74.9,\n9\t      \"AC_pct\": 0.3,\n10\t      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n11\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 11.84,\n12\t      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.09,\n13\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0\n14\t    },\n15\t    \"tables\": [\n16\t      {\n17\t        \"name\": \"Table: WikiEvents ZS Unconstrained Baselines\",\n18\t        \"columns\": [\n19\t          \"Metric\",\n20\t          \"Qwen3-8B\",\n21\t          \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n22\t          \"Mistral-7B\"\n23\t        ],\n24\t        \"rows\": [\n25\t          [\n26\t            \"Parse %\",\n27\t            \"88.6\",\n28\t            \"91.9\",\n29\t            \"78.9\"\n30\t          ],\n31\t          [\n32\t            \"EV %\",\n33\t            \"24.0\",\n34\t            \"10.5\",\n35\t            \"37.3\"\n36\t          ],\n37\t          [\n38\t            \"RoV %\",\n39\t            \"74.9\",\n40\t            \"88.8\",\n41\t            \"63.9\"\n42\t          ],\n43\t          [\n44\t            \"AC %\",\n45\t            \"0.3\",\n46\t            \"0.1\",\n47\t            \"0\"\n48\t          ],\n49\t          [\n50\t            \"CF %\",\n51\t            \"0\",\n52\t            \"0\",\n53\t            \"0\"\n54\t          ],\n55\t          [\n56\t            \"Trigger F1 %\",\n57\t            \"11.8\",\n58\t            \"5.7\",\n59\t            \"2.4\"\n60\t          ],\n61\t          [\n62\t            \"Entity F1 %\",\n63\t            \"0\",\n64\t            \"0\",\n65\t            \"0\"\n66\t          ]\n67\t        ]\n68\t      }\n69\t    ],\n70\t    \"figures\": [],\n71\t    \"analysis\": \"RoV 64-89% vs RE 中 RV 1-30%，量级差异强力支撑 'more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement' 论点。但 Arg F1≈0 是 median 档最大攻击面。 防线：contribution 是 mechanism generalization 不是 SOTA performance；FT composability（P032） 证明约束在 meaningful F1 场景同样有效。\\n\\n\\nKAIROS ontology 56 event types × 80 roles 远超模型词汇先验。RoV 74.9% 因模型在无约束下 几乎随机生成 argument role 名称；EV 24% 因 hierarchical event type 名 （Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode）不在模型常见输出模式中。Entity F1=0% 是 format compliance 问题——模型输出的 entity mention 格式不符 schema，parser 无法识别。 Trigger F1=11.8% 尚可因 trigger 是短文本片段，格式容错更高。 Median 档 skeptic reviewer 会抓住 Arg F1≈0 质疑 'the model can't actually do the task'。\\n\"\n72\t  },\n73\t  {\n74\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B 无约束基线\",\n75\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B 无约束 baseline，246 docs 全量\",\n76\t    \"results\": {\n77\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 91.9,\n78\t      \"EV_pct\": 10.5,\n79\t      \"RoV_pct\": 88.8,\n80\t      \"AC_pct\": 0.1,\n81\t      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n82\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 5.72,\n83\t      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n84\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0\n85\t    },\n86\t    \"tables\": [],\n87\t    \"figures\": [],\n88\t    \"analysis\": \"Llama EV↓ + RoV↑ vs Qwen EV↑ + RoV↓ 的互补模式与 RE 中 Qwen 高 RV + Llama 高 DR 的正交性 finding 平行——不同模型 failure mode 分布不同但约束需求一致。\\n\\n\\nLlama EV 仅 10.5%（Qwen 24%、Mistral 37.3%），说明 Llama 词汇先验对 event type 名称 更友好。但 RoV 88.8% 是三模型最高——几乎随机生成 argument roles。 Entity F1=0% 跨模型一致，确认是 format compliance 问题非个体模型缺陷。 Parse rate 91.9% 最高，Llama 生成 JSON 结构更稳定。\\n\"\n89\t  },\n90\t  {\n91\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B 无约束基线\",\n92\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B-v0.3 无约束 baseline，246 docs 全量\",\n93\t    \"results\": {\n94\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 78.9,\n95\t      \"EV_pct\": 37.3,\n96\t      \"RoV_pct\": 63.9,\n97\t      \"AC_pct\": 0.0,\n98\t      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n99\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 2.41,\n100\t      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n101\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0\n102\t    },\n103\t    \"tables\": [],\n104\t    \"figures\": [],\n105\t    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 作为最弱模型，其高 EV 率反而最能展示 grammar 层价值（EV→0% 绝对降幅 37.3pp 最大）。 但 reviewer 可能质疑 'including a clearly inferior model inflates reported reduction rates'。\\n\\n\\nMistral EV 37.3% 最高——SentencePiece tokenizer (32K vocab) 对含 '.' 分隔符的 hierarchical event type 名称 tokenization 最不友好。Parse rate 78.9% 最低， Trigger F1 仅 2.4%，三模型中表现最差。RoV 63.9% 虽最低但仍极高。 AC=0% 因大部分 argument 的 entity type 已被 RoV 错误掩盖——violation 层级遮蔽效应。\\n\"\n106\t  },\n107\t  {\n108\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral Grammar-Only 消融\",\n109\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents 仅 grammar 层消融 (Mistral-7B)，证明 semantic 层在 EE 中的必要性\",\n110\t    \"results\": {\n111\t      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n112\t      \"EV_pct\": 0.0,\n113\t      \"RoV_pct\": 64.0,\n114\t      \"AC_pct\": 13.8,\n115\t      \"CF_pct\": 1.1,\n116\t      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 3.37,\n117\t      \"entity_f1_pct\": 11.92\n118\t    },\n119\t    \"tables\": [\n120\t      {\n121\t        \"name\": \"Table: WikiEvents EE Ablation (Mistral-7B)\",\n122\t        \"columns\": [\n123\t          \"Config\",\n124\t          \"EV%\",\n125\t          \"RoV%\",\n126\t          \"AC%\",\n127\t          \"CF%\",\n128\t          \"Ent F1%\"\n129\t        ],\n130\t        \"rows\": [\n131\t          [\n132\t            \"Unconstrained\",\n133\t            \"37.3\",\n134\t            \"63.9\",\n135\t            \"0\",\n136\t            \"0\",\n137\t            \"0\"\n138\t          ],\n139\t          [\n140\t            \"Grammar-only\",\n141\t            \"0\",\n142\t            \"64.0\",\n143\t            \"13.8\",\n144\t            \"1.1\",\n145\t            \"11.9\"\n146\t          ],\n147\t          [\n148\t            \"Full S1\",\n149\t            \"0\",\n150\t            \"0\",\n151\t            \"1.3\",\n152\t            \"14.9\",\n153\t            \"11.7\"\n154\t          ]\n155\t        ]\n156\t      }\n157\t    ],\n158\t    \"figures\": [],\n159\t    \"analysis\": \"Grammar-only 消融是 EE 章节最关键证据：RoV 在 grammar-only 下几乎不变（64%），直接证明 semantic 层是 EE 的唯一防线。比 RE 中 semantic-only 仅↓24% 更有说服力。 AC 13.8% 的 latent surfacing 模式强化了 architecture contribution 论证—— 与 RE DocRED 中 grammar 揭露 latent DR 完全平行。\\n\\n\\nGrammar 消除 EV→0%（CFG 约束 event type vocabulary），但 RoV 64%→64% 不变——grammar CFG 无法约束依赖 event context 的 80 个 argument roles。AC 从 0%→13.8% 复现 RE 中 latent violation surfacing 模式：grammar 消除 OOV event types 后暴露之前被掩盖的 argument constraint 违规。CF 1.1% 远低于 full_s1 14.9%——grammar-only 不做 entity type enforcement，不引入 type-drift CF。这是 RE DocRED 中 grammar→DR↑ 模式在 EE 的自然推广。\\n\"\n160\t  },\n161\t  {\n162\t    \"name\": \"WikiEvents EE Post-hoc Filtering 对比\",\n163\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents 三模型 post-hoc filtering baseline——证明 post-hoc 在 EE 中完全不可行\",\n164\t    \"results\": {\n165\t      \"qwen_args_before\": 5467,\n166\t      \"qwen_args_after\": 23,\n167\t      \"qwen_discard_pct\": 99.6,\n168\t      \"llama_args_before\": 5053,\n169\t      \"llama_args_after\": 3,\n170\t      \"llama_discard_pct\": 99.9,\n171\t      \"mistral_args_before\": 6034,\n172\t      \"mistral_args_after\": 0,\n173\t      \"mistral_discard_pct\": 100.0\n174\t    },\n175\t    \"tables\": [\n176\t      {\n177\t        \"name\": \"Table: Post-hoc Filtering Viability (RE vs EE)\",\n178\t        \"columns\": [\n179\t          \"Task\",\n180\t          \"Dataset\",\n181\t          \"Model\",\n182\t          \"Rejection %\",\n183\t          \"Viable?\"\n184\t        ],\n185\t        \"rows\": [\n186\t          [\n187\t            \"RE\",\n188\t            \"SciERC\",\n189\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n190\t            \"16.8\",\n191\t            \"Yes\"\n192\t          ],\n193\t          [\n194\t            \"RE\",\n195\t            \"DocRED\",\n196\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n197\t            \"48.1\",\n198\t            \"Marginal\"\n199\t          ],\n200\t          [\n201\t            \"RE\",\n202\t            \"DocRED\",\n203\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n204\t            \"42.2\",\n205\t            \"Marginal\"\n206\t          ],\n207\t          [\n208\t            \"EE\",\n209\t            \"WikiEvents\",\n210\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n211\t            \"99.6\",\n212\t            \"No\"\n213\t          ],\n214\t          [\n215\t            \"EE\",\n216\t            \"WikiEvents\",\n217\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n218\t            \"99.9\",\n219\t            \"No\"\n220\t          ],\n221\t          [\n222\t            \"EE\",\n223\t            \"WikiEvents\",\n224\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n225\t            \"100.0\",\n226\t            \"No\"\n227\t          ]\n228\t        ]\n229\t      }\n230\t    ],\n231\t    \"figures\": [],\n232\t    \"analysis\": \"Post-hoc 在 EE 的完全失败是论文最强差异化证据之一——直接回应 'why not just filter?'。 Median 档 skeptic 可能反驳 'EE Arg F1≈0 means there's nothing worth filtering anyway'， 但 FT composability (P032) 中 post-hoc 同样会大量丢弃 FT 输出中的 valid arguments， 可作为补充论据。\\n\\n\\nEE 违规率 (RoV 64-89%) 远超 RE (RV+DR ~20-45%)，post-hoc filtering 的破坏性是量级性的。 Mistral 100% 丢弃 = post-hoc 产出空集。Qwen 仅保留 23/5467 arguments (0.4%)。 与 RE DocRED 48.1% rejection 形成鲜明对比：RE 中 post-hoc 虽 costly 但 functional， EE 中完全 non-viable。根因：EE 的 role vocabulary violation 是主导违规类型， 而 post-hoc 必须丢弃所有含非法 role 的 argument，几乎覆盖全部输出。\\n\"\n233\t  },\n234\t  {\n235\t    \"name\": \"70B SciERC ZS 无约束 + 约束\",\n236\t    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 SciERC ZS，验证规模维度泛化 (8B→70B)\",\n237\t    \"results\": {\n238\t      \"unc_DR_pct\": 6.5,\n239\t      \"unc_RV_pct\": 0.6,\n240\t      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n241\t      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 35.17,\n242\t      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 11.22,\n243\t      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.0,\n244\t      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n245\t      \"con_CF_pct\": 3.5,\n246\t      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 35.19,\n247\t      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 11.24,\n248\t      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": 0.02,\n249\t      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 100.0\n250\t    },\n251\t    \"tables\": [\n252\t      {\n253\t        \"name\": \"Table: 70B vs 8B ZS SciERC Comparison\",\n254\t        \"columns\": [\n255\t          \"Model\",\n256\t          \"DR Unc→Con\",\n257\t          \"R-F1\",\n258\t          \"Delta R-F1\",\n259\t          \"CF%\"\n260\t        ],\n261\t        \"rows\": [\n262\t          [\n263\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n264\t            \"15.4→0.93\",\n265\t            \"8.36\",\n266\t            \"+0.13\",\n267\t            \"9.90\"\n268\t          ],\n269\t          [\n270\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n271\t            \"13.3→0.08\",\n272\t            \"2.54\",\n273\t            \"-0.14\",\n274\t            \"6.56\"\n275\t          ],\n276\t          [\n277\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n278\t            \"56.9→13.4\",\n279\t            \"3.67\",\n280\t            \"+0.01\",\n281\t            \"1.27\"\n282\t          ],\n283\t          [\n284\t            \"Llama-70B (AWQ)\",\n285\t            \"6.5→0.0\",\n286\t            \"11.24\",\n287\t            \"+0.02\",\n288\t            \"3.50\"\n289\t          ]\n290\t        ]\n291\t      }\n292\t    ],\n293\t    \"figures\": [],\n294\t    \"analysis\": \"70B DR→0% 是全矩阵中唯一的完全消除（8B 均有残余 0.08-13.4%）。 但 ZS R-F1=11.24% 仍被 skeptic 质疑 practical significance。 Champion reviewer 会欣赏 scale 泛化证据；neutral reviewer 认可但不认为是 key contribution。\\n\\n\\n70B unconstrained DR 仅 6.5%（vs 8B Qwen 15.4%、Llama 13.3%），更大模型本身降低但不消除违规—— 符合 'prompt-level intervention insufficient' 论点的规模版。约束后 DR→0%（比 8B 的 0.93% 更干净）， 因 70B unconstrained DR 已经很低，semantic 层需纠正的 token 更少，fallback 概率更低。 R-F1 delta +0.02pp 完全 F1-neutral。CF 3.5% 低于 8B（Qwen 9.9%、Llama 6.56%）， 70B type assignment 更稳定。R-F1=11.24% 虽然仍是 ZS 低 F1，但显著优于 8B（Qwen 8.36%、Llama 2.54%）。\\n\"\n295\t  },\n296\t  {\n297\t    \"name\": \"70B DocRED ZS 无约束 + 约束\",\n298\t    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 DocRED ZS，96-type 大 ontology 规模验证\",\n299\t    \"results\": {\n300\t      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.02,\n301\t      \"unc_RV_pct\": 7.8,\n302\t      \"unc_DR_pct\": 15.0,\n303\t      \"unc_CF_pct\": 0.07,\n304\t      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 69.03,\n305\t      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 13.03,\n306\t      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.0,\n307\t      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n308\t      \"con_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n309\t      \"con_CF_pct\": 0.04,\n310\t      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 69.11,\n311\t      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 13.05,\n312\t      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": 0.02,\n313\t      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 100.0\n314\t    },\n315\t    \"tables\": [\n316\t      {\n317\t        \"name\": \"Table: 70B vs 8B ZS DocRED Comparison\",\n318\t        \"columns\": [\n319\t          \"Model\",\n320\t          \"DR Unc→Con\",\n321\t          \"R-F1\",\n322\t          \"E-F1\",\n323\t          \"CF%\"\n324\t        ],\n325\t        \"rows\": [\n326\t          [\n327\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n328\t            \"18.5→10.2\",\n329\t            \"8.23\",\n330\t            \"59.37\",\n331\t            \"2.57\"\n332\t          ],\n333\t          [\n334\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n335\t            \"26.1→2.55\",\n336\t            \"6.27\",\n337\t            \"55.01\",\n338\t            \"12.02\"\n339\t          ],\n340\t          [\n341\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n342\t            \"57.4→33.2\",\n343\t            \"5.52\",\n344\t            \"50.59\",\n345\t            \"0.19\"\n346\t          ],\n347\t          [\n348\t            \"Llama-70B (AWQ)\",\n349\t            \"15.0→0.0\",\n350\t            \"13.05\",\n351\t            \"69.11\",\n352\t            \"0.04\"\n353\t          ]\n354\t        ]\n355\t      }\n356\t    ],\n357\t    \"figures\": [],\n358\t    \"analysis\": \"70B DocRED DR→0% + CF→0.04% 是全矩阵最干净的结果。这是论文的 strongest evidence point for scale generalization。但 reviewer 可能追问 'AWQ quantization might introduce systematic bias that happens to reduce CF' — 需归因于 70B 更稳定的 type assignment。\\n\\n\\n70B DocRED unconstrained DR=15%（vs Qwen-8B 18.5%、Llama-8B 26.1%），规模效应有限—— DocRED 96-type ontology 复杂度限制了纯规模带来的改善。约束后 DR→0%（此前 8B 最好也只到 Llama 2.55%），CF 仅 0.04%（远低于 8B 的 2.57-12.02%）。E-F1=69% 显著高于 8B （Qwen 59.4%、Llama 55%），展示 70B 在 entity extraction 的规模优势。 R-F1=13.05% 约为 8B 的两倍（Qwen 8.23%、Llama 6.27%）。 CF 0.04% 异常低——可能因 70B 的 type assignment 更一致，entity-vs-relation type drift 大幅减少。\\n\"\n359\t  },\n360\t  {\n361\t    \"name\": \"Error Analysis / Case Study\",\n362\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents v3 结果中 10-20 个代表性案例：AC 残余根因、CF 根因、定性成功案例\",\n363\t    \"results\": {\n364\t      \"ac_residual_cases_analyzed\": 8,\n365\t      \"ac_root_cause_semantic_confusion_pct\": 72.0,\n366\t      \"ac_root_cause_tokenizer_collision_pct\": 28.0,\n367\t      \"cf_cases_analyzed\": 10,\n368\t      \"cf_root_cause_evr_pct\": 85.0,\n369\t      \"cf_root_cause_within_event_pct\": 15.0,\n370\t      \"qualitative_success_cases\": 5\n371\t    },\n372\t    \"tables\": [\n373\t      {\n374\t        \"name\": \"Table: AC Residual Root Cause (WikiEvents)\",\n375\t        \"columns\": [\n376\t          \"Model\",\n377\t          \"BPE Collisions\",\n378\t          \"Semantic Confusion\",\n379\t          \"Total AC%\"\n380\t        ],\n381\t        \"rows\": [\n382\t          [\n383\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n384\t            \"0 groups\",\n385\t            \"100%\",\n386\t            \"2.1\"\n387\t          ],\n388\t          [\n389\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n390\t            \"0 groups\",\n391\t            \"100%\",\n392\t            \"3.8\"\n393\t          ],\n394\t          [\n395\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n396\t            \"2 groups\",\n397\t            \"38%/62%\",\n398\t            \"1.3\"\n399\t          ]\n400\t        ]\n401\t      }\n402\t    ],\n403\t    \"figures\": [],\n404\t    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis 主要在 appendix。Champion reviewer 会赏识 root cause 分析深度， skeptic reviewer 可能不看。关键是 tokenizer collision 的定量归因—— 为 Mistral AC 残余提供 mechanistic explanation 而非 'it just doesn't work'。\\n\\n\\nAC 残余（Qwen 2.1%、Llama 3.8%、Mistral 1.3%）根因已由 BPE collision diagnostic 确认： Mistral 2 个 collision groups (SID/SEN/SIDE→'S', BAL/BOD→'B') 贡献约 28% AC， 其余 72% 是 model semantic confusion（混淆相似 entity types 如 SID vs SEN vs SIDE）。 Qwen/Llama AC 纯粹是 semantic confusion（0 collision groups）。 CF 根因预期与 RE SciERC 一致：>85% 为 EVR（entity-vs-relation type drift）， <15% 为 within-event inconsistency。成功案例展示 grammar→EV=0、semantic→RoV=0 的级联效果。\\n\"\n405\t  },\n406\t  {\n407\t    \"name\": \"EE FT Composability\",\n408\t    \"description\": \"Fine-tuned Qwen/Llama + OntoCoDec 在 WikiEvents EE 上的组合测试\",\n409\t    \"results\": {\n410\t      \"qwen_ft_unc_rov_pct\": 38.3,\n411\t      \"qwen_ft_unc_ac_pct\": 2.7,\n412\t      \"qwen_ft_con_rov_pct\": 0.0,\n413\t      \"qwen_ft_con_ac_pct\": 0.0,\n414\t      \"qwen_ft_unc_trigger_f1_pct\": 32.1,\n415\t      \"qwen_ft_con_trigger_f1_pct\": 26.7,\n416\t      \"qwen_ft_unc_arg_f1_pct\": 7.9,\n417\t      \"qwen_ft_con_arg_f1_pct\": 8.2,\n418\t      \"llama_ft_unc_rov_pct\": 8.8,\n419\t      \"llama_ft_unc_ac_pct\": 3.5,\n420\t      \"llama_ft_con_rov_pct\": 0.0,\n421\t      \"llama_ft_con_ac_pct\": 0.8,\n422\t      \"llama_ft_unc_trigger_f1_pct\": 27.5,\n423\t      \"llama_ft_con_trigger_f1_pct\": 26.9,\n424\t      \"llama_ft_unc_arg_f1_pct\": 10.0,\n425\t      \"llama_ft_con_arg_f1_pct\": 8.9\n426\t    },\n427\t    \"tables\": [\n428\t      {\n429\t        \"name\": \"Table: EE FT Composability (WikiEvents)\",\n430\t        \"columns\": [\n431\t          \"Model\",\n432\t          \"Mode\",\n433\t          \"RoV%\",\n434\t          \"AC%\",\n435\t          \"Trig-F1%\",\n436\t          \"Arg-F1%\"\n437\t        ],\n438\t        \"rows\": [\n439\t          [\n440\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n441\t            \"FT Unconstrained\",\n442\t            \"38.3\",\n443\t            \"2.7\",\n444\t            \"32.1\",\n445\t            \"7.9\"\n446\t          ],\n447\t          [\n448\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n449\t            \"FT + OntoCoDec\",\n450\t            \"0\",\n451\t            \"0\",\n452\t            \"26.7\",\n453\t            \"8.2\"\n454\t          ],\n455\t          [\n456\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n457\t            \"FT Unconstrained\",\n458\t            \"8.8\",\n459\t            \"3.5\",\n460\t            \"27.5\",\n461\t            \"10.0\"\n462\t          ],\n463\t          [\n464\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n465\t            \"FT + OntoCoDec\",\n466\t            \"0\",\n467\t            \"0.8\",\n468\t            \"26.9\",\n469\t            \"8.9\"\n470\t          ]\n471\t        ]\n472\t      }\n473\t    ],\n474\t    \"figures\": [],\n475\t    \"analysis\": \"EE FT composability 是 rebuttal 关键弹药——回应 'ZS F1 too low' 和 'extensibility is preliminary'。 FT + OntoCoDec 组合展示：(1) violation→0 在高 F1 场景有效，(2) composability 成立， (3) F1 cost 在 FT regime 更小。但 Qwen Trigger F1 -5.4pp 会被 skeptic 追问。 Median 档 reviewer 会视此为 'extensibility demonstration' 的有效证据，但不足以升级为 'cross-task generalization proof'。\\n\\n\\nFT 本身大幅降低违规（RoV 从 74.9/88.8% 降至 38.3/8.8%）但无法消除。 OntoCoDec 将 RoV→0%，确认约束在 FT regime 同样有效。 Arg F1 变化小（Qwen +0.3pp、Llama -1.1pp），因 FT 模型已学会大部分 schema 约束， constrained decoding 只纠正边界 case。Trigger F1 Qwen -5.4pp 是主要负面—— 可能因 constrained decoding 在长序列生成中对 trigger span 的灵活性产生干扰。 Llama Trigger F1 仅 -0.6pp，模型依赖较小。 关键价值：FT Trigger F1 27-32% 和 Arg F1 8-10% 回应 'ZS F1 too low' 质疑—— 证明约束在 meaningful F1 水平下行为正常。\\n\"\n476\t  },\n477\t  {\n478\t    \"name\": \"Grammar-Only Cross-Model EE 消融 (Qwen + Llama)\",\n479\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B 和 Llama-3.1-8B WikiEvents grammar-only 消融，完成三模型消融矩阵\",\n480\t    \"results\": {\n481\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n482\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 68.5,\n483\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 8.2,\n484\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.8,\n485\t      \"qwen_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 13.0,\n486\t      \"llama_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n487\t      \"llama_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 77.0,\n488\t      \"llama_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 14.3,\n489\t      \"llama_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.5,\n490\t      \"llama_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 16.0\n491\t    },\n492\t    \"tables\": [\n493\t      {\n494\t        \"name\": \"Table: WikiEvents Grammar-Only Ablation (3 Models)\",\n495\t        \"columns\": [\n496\t          \"Model\",\n497\t          \"EV%\",\n498\t          \"RoV%\",\n499\t          \"AC%\",\n500\t          \"CF%\",\n501\t          \"Ent F1%\"\n502\t        ],\n503\t        \"rows\": [\n504\t          [\n505\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n506\t            \"0\",\n507\t            \"68.5\",\n508\t            \"8.2\",\n509\t            \"0.8\",\n510\t            \"13.0\"\n511\t          ],\n512\t          [\n513\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n514\t            \"0\",\n515\t            \"77.0\",\n516\t            \"14.3\",\n517\t            \"0.5\",\n518\t            \"16.0\"\n519\t          ],\n520\t          [\n521\t            \"Mistral-7B (actual)\",\n522\t            \"0\",\n523\t            \"64.0\",\n524\t            \"13.8\",\n525\t            \"1.1\",\n526\t            \"11.9\"\n527\t          ]\n528\t        ]\n529\t      }\n530\t    ],\n531\t    \"figures\": [],\n532\t    \"analysis\": \"三模型消融矩阵完备性增强论证力度。但这是 Tier 3 优先级——时间不够可只用 Mistral 单模型 消融放 appendix。Median 档 reviewer 不会因为缺少 Qwen/Llama grammar-only 而降分， 但如果有则是 nice bonus for completeness。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 Mistral grammar-only（RoV 64%, AC 13.8%）和三模型 unconstrained baselines。 Qwen RoV 68.5%——从 unconstrained 74.9% 仅微降，因 grammar CFG 无法约束 context-dependent roles。 Llama RoV 77%——从 88.8% 轻微下降，仍是三模型最高（与 unconstrained 排序一致）。 AC 升至 8.2-14.3% 复现 latent violation surfacing：grammar 消除 EV 后暴露之前被 OOV 掩盖的 AC 违规。Llama AC 14.3% 高于 Qwen 8.2%，与 Llama 在 RE DocRED 中的 higher latent DR 模式一致。 Entity F1 与 full_s1 接近（grammar 驱动 format compliance recovery）。 CF 低因 grammar-only 不做 type enforcement。\\n\"\n533\t  },\n534\t  {\n535\t    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for EE Metrics\",\n536\t    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 指标 bootstrap 置信区间 (10000 iterations, 246 docs)\",\n537\t    \"results\": {\n538\t      \"qwen_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 14.09,\n539\t      \"qwen_entity_f1_95ci\": \"[12.0, 16.2]\",\n540\t      \"qwen_entity_f1_p\": \"<0.001\",\n541\t      \"qwen_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.55,\n542\t      \"qwen_trigger_f1_95ci\": \"[-0.5, 3.6]\",\n543\t      \"qwen_trigger_f1_p\": 0.07,\n544\t      \"llama_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 17.63,\n545\t      \"llama_entity_f1_95ci\": \"[15.1, 20.1]\",\n546\t      \"llama_entity_f1_p\": \"<0.001\",\n547\t      \"llama_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.76,\n548\t      \"llama_trigger_f1_95ci\": \"[0.1, 3.4]\",\n549\t      \"llama_trigger_f1_p\": 0.02,\n550\t      \"mistral_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 11.71,\n551\t      \"mistral_entity_f1_95ci\": \"[9.5, 13.9]\",\n552\t      \"mistral_entity_f1_p\": \"<0.001\",\n553\t      \"mistral_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.46,\n554\t      \"mistral_trigger_f1_95ci\": \"[-0.3, 3.2]\",\n555\t      \"mistral_trigger_f1_p\": 0.05\n556\t    },\n557\t    \"tables\": [\n558\t      {\n559\t        \"name\": \"Table: Bootstrap CI for EE (10000 iterations)\",\n560\t        \"columns\": [\n561\t          \"Model\",\n562\t          \"Metric\",\n563\t          \"Delta (pp)\",\n564\t          \"95% CI\",\n565\t          \"p-value\"\n566\t        ],\n567\t        \"rows\": [\n568\t          [\n569\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n570\t            \"Entity F1\",\n571\t            \"+14.1\",\n572\t            \"[12.0, 16.2]\",\n573\t            \"<0.001\"\n574\t          ],\n575\t          [\n576\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n577\t            \"Trigger F1\",\n578\t            \"+1.6\",\n579\t            \"[-0.5, 3.6]\",\n580\t            \"0.07\"\n581\t          ],\n582\t          [\n583\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n584\t            \"Entity F1\",\n585\t            \"+17.6\",\n586\t            \"[15.1, 20.1]\",\n587\t            \"<0.001\"\n588\t          ],\n589\t          [\n590\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n591\t            \"Trigger F1\",\n592\t            \"+1.8\",\n593\t            \"[0.1, 3.4]\",\n594\t            \"0.02\"\n595\t          ],\n596\t          [\n597\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n598\t            \"Entity F1\",\n599\t            \"+11.7\",\n600\t            \"[9.5, 13.9]\",\n601\t            \"<0.001\"\n602\t          ],\n603\t          [\n604\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n605\t            \"Trigger F1\",\n606\t            \"+1.5\",\n607\t            \"[-0.3, 3.2]\",\n608\t            \"0.05\"\n609\t          ]\n610\t        ]\n611\t      }\n612\t    ],\n613\t    \"figures\": [],\n614\t    \"analysis\": \"Entity F1 显著提升的统计确认强化 'format compliance recovery' 机制论证。 Trigger F1 borderline significance 需诚实报告。Median 档 reviewer 赏识统计严谨性， 但 skeptic 可能指出 'statistical significance of a format-compliance artifact is not the same as semantic improvement'——需在论文中明确区分。\\n\\n\\nEntity F1 从 0%→11-17%，绝对增幅大，246 docs 足够给出窄 CI 和 p<0.001。 但这本质是 format compliance recovery（grammar 使 parser 能识别 entity mentions）， 非语义改进。Trigger F1 增幅 1.5-1.8pp 较小，246 docs 统计功效有限： Qwen/Mistral 预期 borderline significant (p~0.05-0.07)，Llama 可能显著 (p~0.02)。 Arg F1 增幅太小且基数接近 0，CI 预期包含 0——不建议报告显著性声明。 关键限制：246 docs 比 RE 的 551/998 docs 小，CI 更宽。\\n\"\n615\t  },\n616\t  {\n617\t    \"name\": \"Latency Overhead 测量\",\n618\t    \"description\": \"无约束 vs 约束解码 wall-clock 时间对比 + ontology scalability\",\n619\t    \"results\": {\n620\t      \"zs_scierc_overhead_pct\": 13.1,\n621\t      \"zs_scierc_mean_unc_s\": 4.163,\n622\t      \"zs_scierc_mean_con_s\": 4.71,\n623\t      \"ft_scierc_overhead_pct\": 10.0,\n624\t      \"ft_scierc_mean_unc_s\": 2.612,\n625\t      \"ft_scierc_mean_con_s\": 2.873,\n626\t      \"beam4_overhead_pct\": 16.5,\n627\t      \"beam4_mean_unc_s\": 3.446,\n628\t      \"beam4_mean_con_s\": 4.013,\n629\t      \"ontology_small_7types_overhead_pct\": 2.0,\n630\t      \"ontology_xlarge_200types_overhead_pct\": 3.0\n631\t    },\n632\t    \"tables\": [\n633\t      {\n634\t        \"name\": \"Table: Latency Overhead\",\n635\t        \"columns\": [\n636\t          \"Setting\",\n637\t          \"Unc (s/doc)\",\n638\t          \"Con (s/doc)\",\n639\t          \"Overhead %\"\n640\t        ],\n641\t        \"rows\": [\n642\t          [\n643\t            \"ZS SciERC greedy\",\n644\t            \"4.16\",\n645\t            \"4.71\",\n646\t            \"13.1\"\n647\t          ],\n648\t          [\n649\t            \"FT SciERC greedy\",\n650\t            \"2.61\",\n651\t            \"2.87\",\n652\t            \"10.0\"\n653\t          ],\n654\t          [\n655\t            \"FT SciERC beam-4\",\n656\t            \"3.45\",\n657\t            \"4.01\",\n658\t            \"16.5\"\n659\t          ]\n660\t        ]\n661\t      },\n662\t      {\n663\t        \"name\": \"Table: Ontology Scalability\",\n664\t        \"columns\": [\n665\t          \"Ontology Size\",\n666\t          \"Compile (s)\",\n667\t          \"Overhead %\"\n668\t        ],\n669\t        \"rows\": [\n670\t          [\n671\t            \"Small (7 types)\",\n672\t            \"0.33\",\n673\t            \"2.0\"\n674\t          ],\n675\t          [\n676\t            \"Medium (27 types)\",\n677\t            \"0.32\",\n678\t            \"3.0\"\n679\t          ],\n680\t          [\n681\t            \"Large (96 types)\",\n682\t            \"0.35\",\n683\t            \"3.0\"\n684\t          ],\n685\t          [\n686\t            \"XLarge (200+ types)\",\n687\t            \"0.42\",\n688\t            \"3.0\"\n689\t          ]\n690\t        ]\n691\t      }\n692\t    ],\n693\t    \"figures\": [],\n694\t    \"analysis\": \"10-13% overhead 在 reviewer 可接受范围内。但缺少 70B 和 DocRED 长文档的 latency 测量—— reviewer 可能追问 'how does overhead scale with model size and document length?'。 DocRED latency 实验曾失败（p8b），长文档的 overhead 未知。\\n\\n\\nZS 13.1% overhead 来自 grammar compilation（一次性）+ 每 token semantic mask 查找 （O(1) hash table per entity type）。FT 10% 略低因生成 token 总数更少（FT 输出更精确/更短）。 Beam-4 16.5% 因每 beam candidate 需独立 mask 计算。 Ontology scalability 从 7→200+ types 仅 2→3% overhead，因 semantic mask 计算与 ontology 大小线性相关但常数因子极小（hash lookup vs matrix operation）。 远低于 CRANE (2024) 报告的 ~40% 和传统 trie-based 方法的 20-30%。\\n\"\n695\t  },\n696\t  {\n697\t    \"name\": \"70B LoRA SciERC 评估 (无约束 + 约束)\",\n698\t    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned SciERC eval。训练完成 (eval_loss=0.0611, token_acc=97.78%)，eval 尚在 PREPARING。 Median 档关键预测：DR≤0.5%, |ΔR-F1|≤1pp。\\n\",\n699\t    \"results\": {\n700\t      \"unc_DR_pct\": 1.0,\n701\t      \"unc_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n702\t      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n703\t      \"unc_CF_pct\": 0.0,\n704\t      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 68.5,\n705\t      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 46.5,\n706\t      \"unc_parse_fail_pct\": 0.0,\n707\t      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.2,\n708\t      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n709\t      \"con_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n710\t      \"con_CF_pct\": 0.6,\n711\t      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 68.4,\n712\t      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 46.2,\n713\t      \"con_parse_fail_pct\": 0.0,\n714\t      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": -0.3,\n715\t      \"delta_E_F1_pp\": -0.1,\n716\t      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 80.0\n717\t    },\n718\t    \"tables\": [\n719\t      {\n720\t        \"name\": \"Table: 70B LoRA vs 8B LoRA SciERC\",\n721\t        \"columns\": [\n722\t          \"Model\",\n723\t          \"DR%\",\n724\t          \"R-F1%\",\n725\t          \"Delta R-F1\",\n726\t          \"E-F1%\",\n727\t          \"CF%\"\n728\t        ],\n729\t        \"rows\": [\n730\t          [\n731\t            \"Qwen3-8B LoRA\",\n732\t            \"0.00\",\n733\t            \"43.77\",\n734\t            \"-0.09\",\n735\t            \"67.05\",\n736\t            \"1.18\"\n737\t          ],\n738\t          [\n739\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA\",\n740\t            \"0.09\",\n741\t            \"45.47\",\n742\t            \"+0.02\",\n743\t            \"67.76\",\n744\t            \"0.46\"\n745\t          ],\n746\t          [\n747\t            \"Llama-70B LoRA (AWQ)\",\n748\t            \"0.20\",\n749\t            \"46.2\",\n750\t            \"-0.3\",\n751\t            \"68.4\",\n752\t            \"0.60\"\n753\t          ]\n754\t        ]\n755\t      }\n756\t    ],\n757\t    \"figures\": [],\n758\t    \"analysis\": \"DR 0.2% 和 ΔR-F1 -0.3pp 在 median 档范围内（≤0.5%, ≤1pp）。 Reviewer 可能注意到 '8B constrained improves or preserves F1, but 70B constrained slightly hurts F1'——需归因于 AWQ 量化而非方法缺陷，在 footnote 注明 '70B uses AWQ-INT4; full-precision left for future work'。 R-F1 46.2% 是 LoRA regime 中最高值，回应 'practical significance' 质疑。\\n\\n\\n训练 eval_loss 0.0611 略高于 8B LoRA（Qwen 0.0586、Llama 0.0595），token_acc 97.78% 略低于 8B 的 98.16-98.17%——AWQ-INT4 量化引入训练噪声但幅度可控。 Unconstrained DR 预测 1.0%（8B: Qwen 1.95%、Llama 1.11%），70B 规模优势使 DR 降低但 AWQ 阻止达到 <0.5%。Constrained DR 预测 0.2%——semantic mask 在量化 logit 上效果略打折， 因量化 logit 分布更尖锐，mask boundary 处更容易触发 fallback。 R-F1 ~46.5% 高于 Llama-8B (45.47%)，展示规模优势。Delta R-F1 -0.3pp—— AWQ precision loss 在 type token 位置累积，约束引入轻微 F1 惩罚（8B Llama 是 +0.02pp）。 CF 0.6% 介于 8B Qwen (1.18%) 和 Llama (0.46%) 之间。 结论：'可用但不如 8B 干净'——足以作为 scale evidence 但不是 strongest point。\\n\"\n759\t  },\n760\t  {\n761\t    \"name\": \"70B LoRA DocRED 评估 (无约束 + 约束)\",\n762\t    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned DocRED eval。训练完成 (eval_loss=0.0635, token_acc=97.94%)，unconstrained eval RUNNING。 Median 档关键预测：DR≤0.8%, |ΔR-F1|≤1.5pp。\\n\",\n763\t    \"results\": {\n764\t      \"unc_DR_pct\": 0.7,\n765\t      \"unc_RV_pct\": 0.05,\n766\t      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n767\t      \"unc_CF_pct\": 0.05,\n768\t      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 84.5,\n769\t      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 45.8,\n770\t      \"unc_parse_fail_pct\": 1.8,\n771\t      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.5,\n772\t      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n773\t      \"con_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n774\t      \"con_CF_pct\": 0.4,\n775\t      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 84.2,\n776\t      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 45.0,\n777\t      \"con_parse_fail_pct\": 2.5,\n778\t      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": -0.8,\n779\t      \"delta_E_F1_pp\": -0.3,\n780\t      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 28.6\n781\t    },\n782\t    \"tables\": [\n783\t      {\n784\t        \"name\": \"Table: 70B LoRA vs 8B LoRA DocRED\",\n785\t        \"columns\": [\n786\t          \"Model\",\n787\t          \"DR%\",\n788\t          \"R-F1%\",\n789\t          \"Delta R-F1\",\n790\t          \"E-F1%\",\n791\t          \"CF%\",\n792\t          \"PF%\"\n793\t        ],\n794\t        \"rows\": [\n795\t          [\n796\t            \"Qwen3-8B LoRA\",\n797\t            \"0.01\",\n798\t            \"40.56\",\n799\t            \"-0.30\",\n800\t            \"81.43\",\n801\t            \"0.41\",\n802\t            \"8.52\"\n803\t          ],\n804\t          [\n805\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA\",\n806\t            \"0.21\",\n807\t            \"43.78\",\n808\t            \"+0.06\",\n809\t            \"83.94\",\n810\t            \"0.21\",\n811\t            \"2.51\"\n812\t          ],\n813\t          [\n814\t            \"Llama-70B LoRA (AWQ)\",\n815\t            \"0.50\",\n816\t            \"45.0\",\n817\t            \"-0.8\",\n818\t            \"84.2\",\n819\t            \"0.40\",\n820\t            \"2.5\"\n821\t          ]\n822\t        ]\n823\t      }\n824\t    ],\n825\t    \"figures\": [],\n826\t    \"analysis\": \"70B LoRA DocRED 是 median 档中最 risky 的数据点。DR 0.5% 在 ≤0.8% 范围但明显高于 8B (0.01-0.21%)。ΔR-F1 -0.8pp 偏大但在 ≤1.5pp 范围内。 Reviewer 可能质疑 'AWQ quantization interferes with your method at scale'。 防线：(1) 诚实归因 AWQ，(2) constrained 仍远优于 ZS 任何配置（ZS DR 15% vs FT+con 0.5%）， (3) 这是额外 scale evidence 不是 core claim，(4) 提出 full-precision 70B 作 future work。 如果 meta-reviewer 倾向 Findings，70B LoRA 的 imperfect 结果不是 reject 理由， 而是 'needs further validation at scale' 的 Findings-appropriate caveat。\\n\\nDocRED 96-type ontology 对 AWQ-70B 挑战更大。训练 eval_loss 0.0635 高于 8B (Qwen 0.0614、Llama 0.0572-0.0624)——DocRED 的长文档 + AWQ 量化累积更多误差。 Unconstrained DR 0.7%（8B: Qwen 0.76%、Llama 0.49%），与 8B 同量级而非显著更低—— 规模优势被 AWQ noise 抵消。Constrained DR 0.5%（8B: Qwen 0.01%、Llama 0.21%）， 明显高于 8B——DocRED 的 high fallback rate + AWQ noisy logits 导致 semantic mask 效果受限。DR reduction 仅 28.6%（8B Llama 57% reduction），'不如 8B 干净' 在 DocRED 更明显。 R-F1 delta -0.8pp 比 SciERC 的 -0.3pp 更大——DocRED 长文档生成更多 token， 量化误差累积更多。Parse fail 2.5%（略高于 8B 的 2.3-2.5%）， 量化模型在长序列末尾更容易 degenerate。 R-F1 绝对值 45.0% 高于 Llama-8B (43.78%)，规模优势仍然存在。 E-F1 84.2% 与 Llama-8B (83.94%) 接近。\\n\"\n827\t  }\n828\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a8bb760-f9b6-4261-9b0b-0d876b9983da","uuid":"9fc338e6-605d-4f49-92ec-920fba85ca9b","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:08:51.379Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T052642/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B 无约束基线\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents 事件抽取 Qwen3-8B 无约束 baseline，246 docs 全量，建立 EE violation landscape\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n      \"EV_pct\": 24.0,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 74.9,\n      \"AC_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 11.84,\n      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.09,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: WikiEvents ZS Unconstrained Baselines\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Qwen3-8B\",\n          \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n          \"Mistral-7B\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Parse %\",\n            \"88.6\",\n            \"91.9\",\n            \"78.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EV %\",\n            \"24.0\",\n            \"10.5\",\n            \"37.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RoV %\",\n            \"74.9\",\n            \"88.8\",\n            \"63.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"AC %\",\n            \"0.3\",\n            \"0.1\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CF %\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trigger F1 %\",\n            \"11.8\",\n            \"5.7\",\n            \"2.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Entity F1 %\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RoV 64-89% vs RE 中 RV 1-30%，量级差异强力支撑 'more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement' 论点。但 Arg F1≈0 是 median 档最大攻击面。 防线：contribution 是 mechanism generalization 不是 SOTA performance；FT composability（P032） 证明约束在 meaningful F1 场景同样有效。\\n\\n\\nKAIROS ontology 56 event types × 80 roles 远超模型词汇先验。RoV 74.9% 因模型在无约束下 几乎随机生成 argument role 名称；EV 24% 因 hierarchical event type 名 （Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode）不在模型常见输出模式中。Entity F1=0% 是 format compliance 问题——模型输出的 entity mention 格式不符 schema，parser 无法识别。 Trigger F1=11.8% 尚可因 trigger 是短文本片段，格式容错更高。 Median 档 skeptic reviewer 会抓住 Arg F1≈0 质疑 'the model can't actually do the task'。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B 无约束基线\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B 无约束 baseline，246 docs 全量\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 91.9,\n      \"EV_pct\": 10.5,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 88.8,\n      \"AC_pct\": 0.1,\n      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 5.72,\n      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Llama EV↓ + RoV↑ vs Qwen EV↑ + RoV↓ 的互补模式与 RE 中 Qwen 高 RV + Llama 高 DR 的正交性 finding 平行——不同模型 failure mode 分布不同但约束需求一致。\\n\\n\\nLlama EV 仅 10.5%（Qwen 24%、Mistral 37.3%），说明 Llama 词汇先验对 event type 名称 更友好。但 RoV 88.8% 是三模型最高——几乎随机生成 argument roles。 Entity F1=0% 跨模型一致，确认是 format compliance 问题非个体模型缺陷。 Parse rate 91.9% 最高，Llama 生成 JSON 结构更稳定。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B 无约束基线\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B-v0.3 无约束 baseline，246 docs 全量\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 78.9,\n      \"EV_pct\": 37.3,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 63.9,\n      \"AC_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 2.41,\n      \"argument_f1_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 作为最弱模型，其高 EV 率反而最能展示 grammar 层价值（EV→0% 绝对降幅 37.3pp 最大）。 但 reviewer 可能质疑 'including a clearly inferior model inflates reported reduction rates'。\\n\\n\\nMistral EV 37.3% 最高——SentencePiece tokenizer (32K vocab) 对含 '.' 分隔符的 hierarchical event type 名称 tokenization 最不友好。Parse rate 78.9% 最低， Trigger F1 仅 2.4%，三模型中表现最差。RoV 63.9% 虽最低但仍极高。 AC=0% 因大部分 argument 的 entity type 已被 RoV 错误掩盖——violation 层级遮蔽效应。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents Mistral Grammar-Only 消融\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents 仅 grammar 层消融 (Mistral-7B)，证明 semantic 层在 EE 中的必要性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"parse_rate_pct\": 88.6,\n      \"EV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"RoV_pct\": 64.0,\n      \"AC_pct\": 13.8,\n      \"CF_pct\": 1.1,\n      \"trigger_f1_pct\": 3.37,\n      \"entity_f1_pct\": 11.92\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: WikiEvents EE Ablation (Mistral-7B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Config\",\n          \"EV%\",\n          \"RoV%\",\n          \"AC%\",\n          \"CF%\",\n          \"Ent F1%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Unconstrained\",\n            \"37.3\",\n            \"63.9\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Grammar-only\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"64.0\",\n            \"13.8\",\n            \"1.1\",\n            \"11.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Full S1\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"1.3\",\n            \"14.9\",\n            \"11.7\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Grammar-only 消融是 EE 章节最关键证据：RoV 在 grammar-only 下几乎不变（64%），直接证明 semantic 层是 EE 的唯一防线。比 RE 中 semantic-only 仅↓24% 更有说服力。 AC 13.8% 的 latent surfacing 模式强化了 architecture contribution 论证—— 与 RE DocRED 中 grammar 揭露 latent DR 完全平行。\\n\\n\\nGrammar 消除 EV→0%（CFG 约束 event type vocabulary），但 RoV 64%→64% 不变——grammar CFG 无法约束依赖 event context 的 80 个 argument roles。AC 从 0%→13.8% 复现 RE 中 latent violation surfacing 模式：grammar 消除 OOV event types 后暴露之前被掩盖的 argument constraint 违规。CF 1.1% 远低于 full_s1 14.9%——grammar-only 不做 entity type enforcement，不引入 type-drift CF。这是 RE DocRED 中 grammar→DR↑ 模式在 EE 的自然推广。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"WikiEvents EE Post-hoc Filtering 对比\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents 三模型 post-hoc filtering baseline——证明 post-hoc 在 EE 中完全不可行\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_args_before\": 5467,\n      \"qwen_args_after\": 23,\n      \"qwen_discard_pct\": 99.6,\n      \"llama_args_before\": 5053,\n      \"llama_args_after\": 3,\n      \"llama_discard_pct\": 99.9,\n      \"mistral_args_before\": 6034,\n      \"mistral_args_after\": 0,\n      \"mistral_discard_pct\": 100.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Post-hoc Filtering Viability (RE vs EE)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Task\",\n          \"Dataset\",\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Rejection %\",\n          \"Viable?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RE\",\n            \"SciERC\",\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"16.8\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RE\",\n            \"DocRED\",\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"48.1\",\n            \"Marginal\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RE\",\n            \"DocRED\",\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"42.2\",\n            \"Marginal\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EE\",\n            \"WikiEvents\",\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"99.6\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EE\",\n            \"WikiEvents\",\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"99.9\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EE\",\n            \"WikiEvents\",\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"100.0\",\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Post-hoc 在 EE 的完全失败是论文最强差异化证据之一——直接回应 'why not just filter?'。 Median 档 skeptic 可能反驳 'EE Arg F1≈0 means there's nothing worth filtering anyway'， 但 FT composability (P032) 中 post-hoc 同样会大量丢弃 FT 输出中的 valid arguments， 可作为补充论据。\\n\\n\\nEE 违规率 (RoV 64-89%) 远超 RE (RV+DR ~20-45%)，post-hoc filtering 的破坏性是量级性的。 Mistral 100% 丢弃 = post-hoc 产出空集。Qwen 仅保留 23/5467 arguments (0.4%)。 与 RE DocRED 48.1% rejection 形成鲜明对比：RE 中 post-hoc 虽 costly 但 functional， EE 中完全 non-viable。根因：EE 的 role vocabulary violation 是主导违规类型， 而 post-hoc 必须丢弃所有含非法 role 的 argument，几乎覆盖全部输出。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"70B SciERC ZS 无约束 + 约束\",\n    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 SciERC ZS，验证规模维度泛化 (8B→70B)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"unc_DR_pct\": 6.5,\n      \"unc_RV_pct\": 0.6,\n      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 35.17,\n      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 11.22,\n      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_CF_pct\": 3.5,\n      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 35.19,\n      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 11.24,\n      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": 0.02,\n      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 100.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 70B vs 8B ZS SciERC Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"DR Unc→Con\",\n          \"R-F1\",\n          \"Delta R-F1\",\n          \"CF%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"15.4→0.93\",\n            \"8.36\",\n            \"+0.13\",\n            \"9.90\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"13.3→0.08\",\n            \"2.54\",\n            \"-0.14\",\n            \"6.56\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"56.9→13.4\",\n            \"3.67\",\n            \"+0.01\",\n            \"1.27\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-70B (AWQ)\",\n            \"6.5→0.0\",\n            \"11.24\",\n            \"+0.02\",\n            \"3.50\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"70B DR→0% 是全矩阵中唯一的完全消除（8B 均有残余 0.08-13.4%）。 但 ZS R-F1=11.24% 仍被 skeptic 质疑 practical significance。 Champion reviewer 会欣赏 scale 泛化证据；neutral reviewer 认可但不认为是 key contribution。\\n\\n\\n70B unconstrained DR 仅 6.5%（vs 8B Qwen 15.4%、Llama 13.3%），更大模型本身降低但不消除违规—— 符合 'prompt-level intervention insufficient' 论点的规模版。约束后 DR→0%（比 8B 的 0.93% 更干净）， 因 70B unconstrained DR 已经很低，semantic 层需纠正的 token 更少，fallback 概率更低。 R-F1 delta +0.02pp 完全 F1-neutral。CF 3.5% 低于 8B（Qwen 9.9%、Llama 6.56%）， 70B type assignment 更稳定。R-F1=11.24% 虽然仍是 ZS 低 F1，但显著优于 8B（Qwen 8.36%、Llama 2.54%）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"70B DocRED ZS 无约束 + 约束\",\n    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 DocRED ZS，96-type 大 ontology 规模验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.02,\n      \"unc_RV_pct\": 7.8,\n      \"unc_DR_pct\": 15.0,\n      \"unc_CF_pct\": 0.07,\n      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 69.03,\n      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 13.03,\n      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_CF_pct\": 0.04,\n      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 69.11,\n      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 13.05,\n      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": 0.02,\n      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 100.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 70B vs 8B ZS DocRED Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"DR Unc→Con\",\n          \"R-F1\",\n          \"E-F1\",\n          \"CF%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"18.5→10.2\",\n            \"8.23\",\n            \"59.37\",\n            \"2.57\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"26.1→2.55\",\n            \"6.27\",\n            \"55.01\",\n            \"12.02\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"57.4→33.2\",\n            \"5.52\",\n            \"50.59\",\n            \"0.19\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-70B (AWQ)\",\n            \"15.0→0.0\",\n            \"13.05\",\n            \"69.11\",\n            \"0.04\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"70B DocRED DR→0% + CF→0.04% 是全矩阵最干净的结果。这是论文的 strongest evidence point for scale generalization。但 reviewer 可能追问 'AWQ quantization might introduce systematic bias that happens to reduce CF' — 需归因于 70B 更稳定的 type assignment。\\n\\n\\n70B DocRED unconstrained DR=15%（vs Qwen-8B 18.5%、Llama-8B 26.1%），规模效应有限—— DocRED 96-type ontology 复杂度限制了纯规模带来的改善。约束后 DR→0%（此前 8B 最好也只到 Llama 2.55%），CF 仅 0.04%（远低于 8B 的 2.57-12.02%）。E-F1=69% 显著高于 8B （Qwen 59.4%、Llama 55%），展示 70B 在 entity extraction 的规模优势。 R-F1=13.05% 约为 8B 的两倍（Qwen 8.23%、Llama 6.27%）。 CF 0.04% 异常低——可能因 70B 的 type assignment 更一致，entity-vs-relation type drift 大幅减少。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Error Analysis / Case Study\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents v3 结果中 10-20 个代表性案例：AC 残余根因、CF 根因、定性成功案例\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ac_residual_cases_analyzed\": 8,\n      \"ac_root_cause_semantic_confusion_pct\": 72.0,\n      \"ac_root_cause_tokenizer_collision_pct\": 28.0,\n      \"cf_cases_analyzed\": 10,\n      \"cf_root_cause_evr_pct\": 85.0,\n      \"cf_root_cause_within_event_pct\": 15.0,\n      \"qualitative_success_cases\": 5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: AC Residual Root Cause (WikiEvents)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"BPE Collisions\",\n          \"Semantic Confusion\",\n          \"Total AC%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"0 groups\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"2.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"0 groups\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"3.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"2 groups\",\n            \"38%/62%\",\n            \"1.3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis 主要在 appendix。Champion reviewer 会赏识 root cause 分析深度， skeptic reviewer 可能不看。关键是 tokenizer collision 的定量归因—— 为 Mistral AC 残余提供 mechanistic explanation 而非 'it just doesn't work'。\\n\\n\\nAC 残余（Qwen 2.1%、Llama 3.8%、Mistral 1.3%）根因已由 BPE collision diagnostic 确认： Mistral 2 个 collision groups (SID/SEN/SIDE→'S', BAL/BOD→'B') 贡献约 28% AC， 其余 72% 是 model semantic confusion（混淆相似 entity types 如 SID vs SEN vs SIDE）。 Qwen/Llama AC 纯粹是 semantic confusion（0 collision groups）。 CF 根因预期与 RE SciERC 一致：>85% 为 EVR（entity-vs-relation type drift）， <15% 为 within-event inconsistency。成功案例展示 grammar→EV=0、semantic→RoV=0 的级联效果。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"EE FT Composability\",\n    \"description\": \"Fine-tuned Qwen/Llama + OntoCoDec 在 WikiEvents EE 上的组合测试\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_ft_unc_rov_pct\": 38.3,\n      \"qwen_ft_unc_ac_pct\": 2.7,\n      \"qwen_ft_con_rov_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"qwen_ft_con_ac_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"qwen_ft_unc_trigger_f1_pct\": 32.1,\n      \"qwen_ft_con_trigger_f1_pct\": 26.7,\n      \"qwen_ft_unc_arg_f1_pct\": 7.9,\n      \"qwen_ft_con_arg_f1_pct\": 8.2,\n      \"llama_ft_unc_rov_pct\": 8.8,\n      \"llama_ft_unc_ac_pct\": 3.5,\n      \"llama_ft_con_rov_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"llama_ft_con_ac_pct\": 0.8,\n      \"llama_ft_unc_trigger_f1_pct\": 27.5,\n      \"llama_ft_con_trigger_f1_pct\": 26.9,\n      \"llama_ft_unc_arg_f1_pct\": 10.0,\n      \"llama_ft_con_arg_f1_pct\": 8.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: EE FT Composability (WikiEvents)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Mode\",\n          \"RoV%\",\n          \"AC%\",\n          \"Trig-F1%\",\n          \"Arg-F1%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"FT Unconstrained\",\n            \"38.3\",\n            \"2.7\",\n            \"32.1\",\n            \"7.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"FT + OntoCoDec\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"26.7\",\n            \"8.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"FT Unconstrained\",\n            \"8.8\",\n            \"3.5\",\n            \"27.5\",\n            \"10.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"FT + OntoCoDec\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0.8\",\n            \"26.9\",\n            \"8.9\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"EE FT composability 是 rebuttal 关键弹药——回应 'ZS F1 too low' 和 'extensibility is preliminary'。 FT + OntoCoDec 组合展示：(1) violation→0 在高 F1 场景有效，(2) composability 成立， (3) F1 cost 在 FT regime 更小。但 Qwen Trigger F1 -5.4pp 会被 skeptic 追问。 Median 档 reviewer 会视此为 'extensibility demonstration' 的有效证据，但不足以升级为 'cross-task generalization proof'。\\n\\n\\nFT 本身大幅降低违规（RoV 从 74.9/88.8% 降至 38.3/8.8%）但无法消除。 OntoCoDec 将 RoV→0%，确认约束在 FT regime 同样有效。 Arg F1 变化小（Qwen +0.3pp、Llama -1.1pp），因 FT 模型已学会大部分 schema 约束， constrained decoding 只纠正边界 case。Trigger F1 Qwen -5.4pp 是主要负面—— 可能因 constrained decoding 在长序列生成中对 trigger span 的灵活性产生干扰。 Llama Trigger F1 仅 -0.6pp，模型依赖较小。 关键价值：FT Trigger F1 27-32% 和 Arg F1 8-10% 回应 'ZS F1 too low' 质疑—— 证明约束在 meaningful F1 水平下行为正常。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Grammar-Only Cross-Model EE 消融 (Qwen + Llama)\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B 和 Llama-3.1-8B WikiEvents grammar-only 消融，完成三模型消融矩阵\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 68.5,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 8.2,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.8,\n      \"qwen_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 13.0,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_EV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_RoV_pct\": 77.0,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_AC_pct\": 14.3,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_CF_pct\": 0.5,\n      \"llama_grammar_only_entity_f1_pct\": 16.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: WikiEvents Grammar-Only Ablation (3 Models)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"EV%\",\n          \"RoV%\",\n          \"AC%\",\n          \"CF%\",\n          \"Ent F1%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"68.5\",\n            \"8.2\",\n            \"0.8\",\n            \"13.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"77.0\",\n            \"14.3\",\n            \"0.5\",\n            \"16.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B (actual)\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"64.0\",\n            \"13.8\",\n            \"1.1\",\n            \"11.9\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三模型消融矩阵完备性增强论证力度。但这是 Tier 3 优先级——时间不够可只用 Mistral 单模型 消融放 appendix。Median 档 reviewer 不会因为缺少 Qwen/Llama grammar-only 而降分， 但如果有则是 nice bonus for completeness。\\n\\n\\n预测基于 Mistral grammar-only（RoV 64%, AC 13.8%）和三模型 unconstrained baselines。 Qwen RoV 68.5%——从 unconstrained 74.9% 仅微降，因 grammar CFG 无法约束 context-dependent roles。 Llama RoV 77%——从 88.8% 轻微下降，仍是三模型最高（与 unconstrained 排序一致）。 AC 升至 8.2-14.3% 复现 latent violation surfacing：grammar 消除 EV 后暴露之前被 OOV 掩盖的 AC 违规。Llama AC 14.3% 高于 Qwen 8.2%，与 Llama 在 RE DocRED 中的 higher latent DR 模式一致。 Entity F1 与 full_s1 接近（grammar 驱动 format compliance recovery）。 CF 低因 grammar-only 不做 type enforcement。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for EE Metrics\",\n    \"description\": \"WikiEvents EE 指标 bootstrap 置信区间 (10000 iterations, 246 docs)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 14.09,\n      \"qwen_entity_f1_95ci\": \"[12.0, 16.2]\",\n      \"qwen_entity_f1_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"qwen_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.55,\n      \"qwen_trigger_f1_95ci\": \"[-0.5, 3.6]\",\n      \"qwen_trigger_f1_p\": 0.07,\n      \"llama_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 17.63,\n      \"llama_entity_f1_95ci\": \"[15.1, 20.1]\",\n      \"llama_entity_f1_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"llama_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.76,\n      \"llama_trigger_f1_95ci\": \"[0.1, 3.4]\",\n      \"llama_trigger_f1_p\": 0.02,\n      \"mistral_entity_f1_delta_pp\": 11.71,\n      \"mistral_entity_f1_95ci\": \"[9.5, 13.9]\",\n      \"mistral_entity_f1_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"mistral_trigger_f1_delta_pp\": 1.46,\n      \"mistral_trigger_f1_95ci\": \"[-0.3, 3.2]\",\n      \"mistral_trigger_f1_p\": 0.05\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Bootstrap CI for EE (10000 iterations)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Delta (pp)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"Entity F1\",\n            \"+14.1\",\n            \"[12.0, 16.2]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"Trigger F1\",\n            \"+1.6\",\n            \"[-0.5, 3.6]\",\n            \"0.07\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"Entity F1\",\n            \"+17.6\",\n            \"[15.1, 20.1]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"Trigger F1\",\n            \"+1.8\",\n            \"[0.1, 3.4]\",\n            \"0.02\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"Entity F1\",\n            \"+11.7\",\n            \"[9.5, 13.9]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"Trigger F1\",\n            \"+1.5\",\n            \"[-0.3, 3.2]\",\n            \"0.05\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Entity F1 显著提升的统计确认强化 'format compliance recovery' 机制论证。 Trigger F1 borderline significance 需诚实报告。Median 档 reviewer 赏识统计严谨性， 但 skeptic 可能指出 'statistical significance of a format-compliance artifact is not the same as semantic improvement'——需在论文中明确区分。\\n\\n\\nEntity F1 从 0%→11-17%，绝对增幅大，246 docs 足够给出窄 CI 和 p<0.001。 但这本质是 format compliance recovery（grammar 使 parser 能识别 entity mentions）， 非语义改进。Trigger F1 增幅 1.5-1.8pp 较小，246 docs 统计功效有限： Qwen/Mistral 预期 borderline significant (p~0.05-0.07)，Llama 可能显著 (p~0.02)。 Arg F1 增幅太小且基数接近 0，CI 预期包含 0——不建议报告显著性声明。 关键限制：246 docs 比 RE 的 551/998 docs 小，CI 更宽。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Latency Overhead 测量\",\n    \"description\": \"无约束 vs 约束解码 wall-clock 时间对比 + ontology scalability\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"zs_scierc_overhead_pct\": 13.1,\n      \"zs_scierc_mean_unc_s\": 4.163,\n      \"zs_scierc_mean_con_s\": 4.71,\n      \"ft_scierc_overhead_pct\": 10.0,\n      \"ft_scierc_mean_unc_s\": 2.612,\n      \"ft_scierc_mean_con_s\": 2.873,\n      \"beam4_overhead_pct\": 16.5,\n      \"beam4_mean_unc_s\": 3.446,\n      \"beam4_mean_con_s\": 4.013,\n      \"ontology_small_7types_overhead_pct\": 2.0,\n      \"ontology_xlarge_200types_overhead_pct\": 3.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Latency Overhead\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Setting\",\n          \"Unc (s/doc)\",\n          \"Con (s/doc)\",\n          \"Overhead %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"ZS SciERC greedy\",\n            \"4.16\",\n            \"4.71\",\n            \"13.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FT SciERC greedy\",\n            \"2.61\",\n            \"2.87\",\n            \"10.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FT SciERC beam-4\",\n            \"3.45\",\n            \"4.01\",\n            \"16.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Ontology Scalability\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Ontology Size\",\n          \"Compile (s)\",\n          \"Overhead %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Small (7 types)\",\n            \"0.33\",\n            \"2.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Medium (27 types)\",\n            \"0.32\",\n            \"3.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Large (96 types)\",\n            \"0.35\",\n            \"3.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"XLarge (200+ types)\",\n            \"0.42\",\n            \"3.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"10-13% overhead 在 reviewer 可接受范围内。但缺少 70B 和 DocRED 长文档的 latency 测量—— reviewer 可能追问 'how does overhead scale with model size and document length?'。 DocRED latency 实验曾失败（p8b），长文档的 overhead 未知。\\n\\n\\nZS 13.1% overhead 来自 grammar compilation（一次性）+ 每 token semantic mask 查找 （O(1) hash table per entity type）。FT 10% 略低因生成 token 总数更少（FT 输出更精确/更短）。 Beam-4 16.5% 因每 beam candidate 需独立 mask 计算。 Ontology scalability 从 7→200+ types 仅 2→3% overhead，因 semantic mask 计算与 ontology 大小线性相关但常数因子极小（hash lookup vs matrix operation）。 远低于 CRANE (2024) 报告的 ~40% 和传统 trie-based 方法的 20-30%。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"70B LoRA SciERC 评估 (无约束 + 约束)\",\n    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned SciERC eval。训练完成 (eval_loss=0.0611, token_acc=97.78%)，eval 尚在 PREPARING。 Median 档关键预测：DR≤0.5%, |ΔR-F1|≤1pp。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"unc_DR_pct\": 1.0,\n      \"unc_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"unc_CF_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 68.5,\n      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 46.5,\n      \"unc_parse_fail_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.2,\n      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_CF_pct\": 0.6,\n      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 68.4,\n      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 46.2,\n      \"con_parse_fail_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": -0.3,\n      \"delta_E_F1_pp\": -0.1,\n      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 80.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 70B LoRA vs 8B LoRA SciERC\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"DR%\",\n          \"R-F1%\",\n          \"Delta R-F1\",\n          \"E-F1%\",\n          \"CF%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B LoRA\",\n            \"0.00\",\n            \"43.77\",\n            \"-0.09\",\n            \"67.05\",\n            \"1.18\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA\",\n            \"0.09\",\n            \"45.47\",\n            \"+0.02\",\n            \"67.76\",\n            \"0.46\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-70B LoRA (AWQ)\",\n            \"0.20\",\n            \"46.2\",\n            \"-0.3\",\n            \"68.4\",\n            \"0.60\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DR 0.2% 和 ΔR-F1 -0.3pp 在 median 档范围内（≤0.5%, ≤1pp）。 Reviewer 可能注意到 '8B constrained improves or preserves F1, but 70B constrained slightly hurts F1'——需归因于 AWQ 量化而非方法缺陷，在 footnote 注明 '70B uses AWQ-INT4; full-precision left for future work'。 R-F1 46.2% 是 LoRA regime 中最高值，回应 'practical significance' 质疑。\\n\\n\\n训练 eval_loss 0.0611 略高于 8B LoRA（Qwen 0.0586、Llama 0.0595），token_acc 97.78% 略低于 8B 的 98.16-98.17%——AWQ-INT4 量化引入训练噪声但幅度可控。 Unconstrained DR 预测 1.0%（8B: Qwen 1.95%、Llama 1.11%），70B 规模优势使 DR 降低但 AWQ 阻止达到 <0.5%。Constrained DR 预测 0.2%——semantic mask 在量化 logit 上效果略打折， 因量化 logit 分布更尖锐，mask boundary 处更容易触发 fallback。 R-F1 ~46.5% 高于 Llama-8B (45.47%)，展示规模优势。Delta R-F1 -0.3pp—— AWQ precision loss 在 type token 位置累积，约束引入轻微 F1 惩罚（8B Llama 是 +0.02pp）。 CF 0.6% 介于 8B Qwen (1.18%) 和 Llama (0.46%) 之间。 结论：'可用但不如 8B 干净'——足以作为 scale evidence 但不是 strongest point。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"70B LoRA DocRED 评估 (无约束 + 约束)\",\n    \"description\": \"Llama-3.1-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned DocRED eval。训练完成 (eval_loss=0.0635, token_acc=97.94%)，unconstrained eval RUNNING。 Median 档关键预测：DR≤0.8%, |ΔR-F1|≤1.5pp。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"unc_DR_pct\": 0.7,\n      \"unc_RV_pct\": 0.05,\n      \"unc_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"unc_CF_pct\": 0.05,\n      \"unc_E_F1_pct\": 84.5,\n      \"unc_R_F1_pct\": 45.8,\n      \"unc_parse_fail_pct\": 1.8,\n      \"con_DR_pct\": 0.5,\n      \"con_RV_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_ET_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"con_CF_pct\": 0.4,\n      \"con_E_F1_pct\": 84.2,\n      \"con_R_F1_pct\": 45.0,\n      \"con_parse_fail_pct\": 2.5,\n      \"delta_R_F1_pp\": -0.8,\n      \"delta_E_F1_pp\": -0.3,\n      \"DR_reduction_pct\": 28.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 70B LoRA vs 8B LoRA DocRED\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"DR%\",\n          \"R-F1%\",\n          \"Delta R-F1\",\n          \"E-F1%\",\n          \"CF%\",\n          \"PF%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B LoRA\",\n            \"0.01\",\n            \"40.56\",\n            \"-0.30\",\n            \"81.43\",\n            \"0.41\",\n            \"8.52\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA\",\n            \"0.21\",\n            \"43.78\",\n            \"+0.06\",\n            \"83.94\",\n            \"0.21\",\n            \"2.51\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-70B LoRA (AWQ)\",\n            \"0.50\",\n            \"45.0\",\n            \"-0.8\",\n            \"84.2\",\n            \"0.40\",\n            \"2.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"70B LoRA DocRED 是 median 档中最 risky 的数据点。DR 0.5% 在 ≤0.8% 范围但明显高于 8B (0.01-0.21%)。ΔR-F1 -0.8pp 偏大但在 ≤1.5pp 范围内。 Reviewer 可能质疑 'AWQ quantization interferes with your method at scale'。 防线：(1) 诚实归因 AWQ，(2) constrained 仍远优于 ZS 任何配置（ZS DR 15% vs FT+con 0.5%）， (3) 这是额外 scale evidence 不是 core claim，(4) 提出 full-precision 70B 作 future work。 如果 meta-reviewer 倾向 Findings，70B LoRA 的 imperfect 结果不是 reject 理由， 而是 'needs further validation at scale' 的 Findings-appropriate caveat。\\n\\nDocRED 96-type ontology 对 AWQ-70B 挑战更大。训练 eval_loss 0.0635 高于 8B (Qwen 0.0614、Llama 0.0572-0.0624)——DocRED 的长文档 + AWQ 量化累积更多误差。 Unconstrained DR 0.7%（8B: Qwen 0.76%、Llama 0.49%），与 8B 同量级而非显著更低—— 规模优势被 AWQ noise 抵消。Constrained DR 0.5%（8B: Qwen 0.01%、Llama 0.21%）， 明显高于 8B——DocRED 的 high fallback rate + AWQ noisy logits 导致 semantic mask 效果受限。DR reduction 仅 28.6%（8B Llama 57% reduction），'不如 8B 干净' 在 DocRED 更明显。 R-F1 delta -0.8pp 比 SciERC 的 -0.3pp 更大——DocRED 长文档生成更多 token， 量化误差累积更多。Parse fail 2.5%（略高于 8B 的 2.3-2.5%）， 量化模型在长序列末尾更容易 degenerate。 R-F1 绝对值 45.0% 高于 Llama-8B (43.78%)，规模优势仍然存在。 E-F1 84.2% 与 Llama-8B (83.94%) 接近。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":828,"startLine":1,"totalLines":828}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016N6udo8GJfGoXaEiWz1abN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# OntoCoDec — Paper Framing\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\tEMNLP 2026 (ARR submission May 25, 2026) — **目标: conference main**（D040, 用户明确指示）\n5\t\n6\t## Title\n7\tOntoCoDec: Type-Valid Information Extraction via Compiled Ontology Constraints\n8\t(D015: \"Near-Complete\" dropped — DocRED residual DR=10.21% (Qwen) 不算 near-complete。论文贡献是方法，不是特定消除率。SciERC 0.93% 和 DocRED 2.55% (Llama) 可在正文中描述为 near-complete，但 title 不宜 overclaim。)\n9\t\n10\t**D040 Story 升级方向**: 从 \"IE-specific constrained decoding\" → \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework\"。WikiEvents Event Extraction 验证跨任务泛化。Continuation masking v2 突破（10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic violations ↓95.8%）初步确认跨任务有效性，全量实验进行中。最终 title 待全量结果后调整。\n11\t\n12\t## Core Insight\n13\tLLM-based IE systems produce systematic ontology constraint violations concentrated in specific relation types. Prompt-level intervention (schema-informed prompting) reduces violations by ~62% but cannot eliminate them — certain relation types retain 25-30% violation rates even with explicit constraint descriptions. OntoCoDec provides **near-complete elimination (DR 15.4%→0.93%, ↓94%) at zero or positive F1 impact** through automatic ontology-to-decoder constraint compilation with two complementary layers.\n14\t\n15\t**Phase 2 confirmed (D012 bootstrap CI, v2 fix)**: Grammar+Semantic dual-layer constrained decoding reduces domain/range violations by 94%, eliminates entity-type and relation-vocabulary violations entirely (→0%). F1 impact is **dataset-dependent**:\n16\t- SciERC: Rel F1 neutral (+0.13pp, p=0.58), Ent F1 neutral (-0.03pp, p=0.53)\n17\t- DocRED: Rel F1 **significantly improved** (+0.50pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.23, +0.81]); Ent F1 **significantly improved** (+1.23pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.94, +1.55])\n18\t- Mechanism: grammar 消除 OOV relation names (DocRED RV 29.66%→0.03%) + 非标 entity types (ET 2.48%→0%)。all_set F1 方法下 OOV=FP → fewer FP → higher precision/F1。SciERC baseline RV/ET 已很低，效果不显著。\n19\t- **Grammar 层是 F1 提升的唯一来源**: grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37% (Δ+0.01pp, p=0.66)。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献，专注 DR reduction。\n20\t\n21\t## Core Claims\n22\t\n23\t### Claim 1 (Empirical): Violation Landscape\n24\tLLM-based IE systems violate ontology type constraints at non-trivial rates (15.4% per-triple on SciERC, 18.7% on DocRED). Violations are **not uniformly distributed** — they concentrate on relation types with tight domain/range constraints (Feature-of 33.5%, Compare 42.4%) while loose-constraint relations show near-zero violation (Used-for 0.8%).\n25\t\n26\t**Key insight**: Violation rate is driven by **constraint tightness**, not ontology size. A small ontology with tight constraints can produce more violations than a large ontology with loose constraints.\n27\t\n28\t**D014 修订**: DR reduction ceiling 由 **tightness × model RV baseline** 共同决定，非 tightness 单因素。Llama DocRED DR↓90.2% vs Qwen DR↓44.7%（同一 ontology τ̄=0.842）。机制：Qwen RV=29.66% >> Llama RV=16.03% → grammar 层将 OOV triples 强制匹配有效关系名 → 揭露大量 latent DR violations → 残余 DR 更高。这是比单一 tightness 更深的 insight。\n29\t\n30\t**Evidence**: SciERC (7 relations) 15.4%; DocRED (96 relations) 18.7% — comparable rates despite 14× ontology size difference. Schema-informed prompt on DocRED only achieves DR↓32% (vs SciERC ↓62%), confirming **prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity**.\n31\t\n32\t### Claim 2 (Empirical): Prompt Insufficiency\n33\tSchema-informed prompting (explicitly describing domain/range constraints in the prompt) reduces but does not eliminate violations:\n34\t- Overall: 15.4% → 5.78% (-62.4%), still above 5%\n35\t- Per-relation: Compare 42.4% → 27.6%, Evaluate-for 24.1% → 29.9% (**worse**)\n36\t- Prompt intervention is unreliable at the per-relation level — some relations improve, one regresses\n37\t\n38\t**Narrative**: This is NOT about \"5.78% barely above 5%\". The story is: **prompt-level intervention is fundamentally unreliable as a guarantee mechanism**. It works statistically but cannot provide per-instance compliance. Three specific relation types retain >10% violation rates with schema-informed prompts. For safety-critical IE (biomedical, legal, regulatory), statistical reduction is insufficient — guaranteed compliance is required.\n39\t\n40\t### Claim 3 (Methodological): Composable Constraint Framework\n41\tOntoCoDec automatically compiles IE ontology schemas into two composable constraint layers:\n42\t1. **Grammar layer** (XGrammar): JSON structure + type vocabulary constraints (CFG-expressible)\n43\t2. **Semantic layer** (TypeConstraintProcessor): Cross-field domain/range constraints via stateful entity registry + dynamic logit masking\n44\t\n45\tThe two layers are **complementary with enabling dependency**: grammar ensures every generated relation type is in the valid vocabulary, which enables the semantic layer to look up and enforce domain/range rules for that type. Without grammar, the semantic layer encounters unknown relation types and cannot enforce constraints (explaining why semantic_only achieves only ↓24% vs full_s1 ↓94%). This is NOT \"synergistic\" (mutual amplification) — grammar is a prerequisite for semantic, not vice versa.\n46\t\n47\tThe two layers compose via bitwise AND of token masks. Recommended framing: \"Grammar and semantic constraints compose via bitwise AND with an enabling dependency: grammar ensures structural validity, enabling semantic constraints to enforce domain/range rules. When constraint tightness creates empty intersection between layers, the system degrades gracefully to grammar-only constraints, maintaining structural validity as a guaranteed floor.\"\n48\t\n49\t**Graceful degradation + Fallback 频率量化** (D008 + Reviewer 发现):\n50\tWhen $M_{semantic} \\cap M_{grammar} = \\emptyset$, the system falls back to grammar-only control.\n51\t\n52\t**关键量化数据（Reviewer 从日志挖掘）**:\n53\t- Llama DocRED full_s1: **32,921 次 fallback / 577 docs = ~57 次/doc**\n54\t- Llama SciERC full_s1: **5,882 次 fallback / 550 docs = ~10.7 次/doc**\n55\t- DocRED fallback 频率是 SciERC 的 **5.3×**\n56\t- Qwen DocRED fallback 率未知（日志当时无 fallback logging，需估算）\n57\t\n58\t**这直接解释了 DocRED DR 残余 10.19% vs SciERC 0.93%**: 更多 token 位置退化为 grammar-only → grammar-only 的 DR 已知为 26.17% → 高 fallback = 高残余 DR。\n59\t\n60\t**论文建议**: 在 §5 tightness 段报告 fallback 率，定义 \"Constraint Coverage\" 指标（semantic masking 实际生效的 token 比例）。这把 \"10.19% DR 残余\" 从弱点变成可量化分析的 finding。Frame as \"engineering robustness\" in §4; fallback 频率 + tightness 作为 §5 定量分析。\n61\t\n62\t**Decidability taxonomy**: Constraints classified by prefix-decidability:\n63\t- (a) Purely local: entity type ∈ vocabulary (grammar layer)\n64\t- (b) Prefix-decidable with state: relation argument types compatible with domain/range (semantic layer, requires entity registry)\n65\t- (c) Truly non-local: forward coreference — out of scope for forward-only decoding\n66\t\n67\t### Claim 4 (Methodological): S1 vs S2 Decoding Strategies — Architectural Ablation\n68\t- S1 (single-pass): Both layers applied throughout generation. **Recommended primary strategy** — simpler, slightly better metrics across the board.\n69\t- S2 (two-pass): Pass 1 extracts entities (grammar-only), Pass 2 generates relations with input-dependent grammar compiled from Pass 1 entities.\n70\t\n71\t**S2 full results (551/551 SciERC)**: DR 0.97% (vs S1 0.93%), CF 8.03% (vs S1 9.9%), R-F1 8.03% (vs S1 8.36%). S2 does NOT solve CF — the 1.87pp reduction is not significant. S2 also slightly worse on DR and F1. **S2 is an architectural variant demonstrating framework flexibility, not a CF solution.** Position in paper as ablation (Section 5 or Appendix), not as a core contribution.\n72\t\n73\t⚠️ **Do NOT cite pilot50 DR=0% as S2 evidence** — small-sample artifact; full run shows DR=0.97%. Per-relation S2 DR is worse than S1 on Compare (4.6% vs 2.82%), Part-of (1.25% vs 0%), Used-for (0.12% vs 0%).\n74\t\n75\t### Claim 5 (Empirical): Cross-Task Generalization — Event Extraction (D040, NEW)\n76\t**Status**: ✅ All 3 models × 246 docs complete (v3 with collision fix + exact-match fix)\n77\t\n78\tOntoCoDec generalizes beyond Relation Extraction to **Event Extraction** (WikiEvents, Li et al. NAACL 2021), demonstrating that the framework is task-agnostic for any IE task with ontology-defined type constraints.\n79\t\n80\t**Cross-task framing (Reviewer 评估 confirmed)**:\n81\t- **RoV 是 DR 的正确对应物**（不是 RV）：EE 中 per-type violation rate 是 RE 的 3-5×，支持 \"more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement\" claim\n82\t- **三层级联 Grammar→RoV→AC**（比 RE 的 Grammar→DR 两层更丰富）：grammar 消除 EV，使 semantic layer 可以 enforce role restriction (RoV→0%)，进而暴露 AC violations。这强化 architecture contribution 论证。\n83\t- **Semantic layer 是 EE 的唯一防线**：grammar 层对 role vocabulary 无能力，只有 semantic layer + continuation masking 能 enforce per-event-type role constraints\n84\t- **\"Practical value\" 防线**：Arg F1 ≈ 0% 不削弱 claim，因为 (a) mechanism generalization 是 contribution 不是 SOTA performance，(b) FT composability 已在 RE 中证明 high-F1 场景有效\n85\t\n86\t**WikiEvents specifics** (DARPA KAIROS ontology):\n87\t- 56 event types × 80 argument roles × 27 entity types（含 5 个补充 Contact 子类型 + CRM entity type）\n88\t- 245 组显式 (event_type, role) → allowed_entity_types 约束\n89\t- Maps directly to OntoCoDec's semantic layer: argument role type constraints ≡ domain/range constraints\n90\t- 27 entity types（比 ACE05 的 7 个更丰富）→ constraint space 更大，更能展示 semantic layer 价值\n91\t- 99.98% 数据满足约束 → 约束定义是真实有效的\n92\t- Hierarchical event names (e.g., Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode) → 扁平化为 leaf-node 解决 first-token collision（96.1%→3.9%）\n93\t\n94\t**数据集选择理由**（MAVEN/RAMS 排除）：\n95\t- MAVEN (168 types): 无 argument extraction，不适用\n96\t- MAVEN-Arg (162 types): FrameNet-based，无 role→entity_type schema 约束\n97\t- RAMS (139 types): 仅 cardinality 约束，无 entity type binding\n98\t- ACE05 (33 types): LDC 付费，采购周期来不及\n99\t- **WikiEvents 是唯一同时满足 \"免费 + 有显式 role→entity_type 约束\" 的数据集**\n100\t\n101\t**Violation 分类** (5 类，从 RE 的 4 类扩展):\n102\t- ET (Entity Type): entity type 不在 ontology 合法类型列表中\n103\t- EV (Event Vocabulary): event type 不在 ontology 定义中\n104\t- RoV (Role Vocabulary): argument role 不在该 event type 定义中\n105\t- AC (Argument Constraint): argument entity type 不满足 role→entity_type 约束（DR 的自然推广）\n106\t- CF (Cross-Field): 同一 entity 跨 event 被赋予不同 type\n107\t\n108\t**Full results (246 docs, v3 final — collision fix + exact-match fix)**:\n109\t\n110\t| Metric | Qwen3-8B uncon. | Qwen3-8B Full S1 | Llama-3.1-8B uncon. | Llama-3.1-8B Full S1 | Mistral-7B uncon. | Mistral-7B Full S1 |\n111\t|--------|-----------------|-------------------|---------------------|----------------------|-------------------|---------------------|\n112\t| Parse | 88.6% | 83.7% | 91.9% | 84.1% | 88.6% | 88.6% |\n113\t| EV | 24.0% | **0%** | 10.5% | **0%** | 37.3% | **0%** |\n114\t| RoV | 74.9% | **0%** | 88.8% | **0%** | 63.9% | **0%** |\n115\t| AC | 0.3% | 2.1% | 0.1% | 3.8% | 0% | 1.3% |\n116\t| CF | 0% | 21.1% | 0% | 17.2% | 0% | 14.9% |\n117\t| Trigger F1 | 11.8% | 13.4% | 5.7% | 7.5% | 2.4% | 3.9% |\n118\t| Ent F1 | 0% | 14.1% | 0% | 17.6% | 0% | 11.7% |\n119\t\n120\t**Grammar-only ablation (Mistral v3, all 3 models)**:\n121\t- Grammar eliminates EV→0% but RoV remains 64-77%: grammar CFG cannot constrain 80 argument roles conditioned on event context\n122\t- AC rises to 8-14% under grammar-only (latent violation surfacing pattern, same as DocRED RE)\n123\t- Proves semantic layer is essential for EE: two-layer architecture is necessary, not just convenient\n124\t\n125\t**Post-hoc filtering comparison (devastating)**:\n126\t- Qwen: 5,467→23 arguments (99.6% discarded) to reach 0% violation\n127\t- Llama: 5,053→3 arguments (99.9% discarded)\n128\t- Mistral: 6,034→0 arguments (100% discarded)\n129\t- Post-hoc is not viable for EE (contrasts with RE where it's expensive but functional)\n130\t\n131\t**BPE collision diagnostic (confirmed 2026-05-18)**:\n132\t- Qwen (BPE, ~152K vocab): **0 collision groups** — all 27 entity types have unique first tokens\n133\t- Llama (BPE, ~128K vocab): **0 collision groups** — same\n134\t- Mistral (SentencePiece, ~32K vocab): **2 collision groups** (SID/SEN/SIDE→'S', BAL/BOD→'B')\n135\t- **Residual AC narrative**: Mistral AC 1.3% = residual after collision fix (was 16.6%); Qwen/Llama AC 2.1-3.8% = purely model semantic confusion (confuses similar entity types like SID vs SEN), NOT tokenizer collision\n136\t\n137\t**关键 findings**:\n138\t- RoV 是压倒性违规（64-89%），远超 RE 的 RV（1-30%）→ 更强力展示 constraint 需求\n139\t- EV 显著（10-37%）→ grammar 层直接消除\n140\t- **Entity F1 从 0% 恢复到 11.7-17.6%**: 不是语义改进，是 format compliance 恢复——grammar enforcement 产生 schema-valid JSON，parser 才能识别 entity mentions\n141\t- Trigger F1 +1.5 to +1.8pp: elimination of OOV event types counted as FP\n142\t- CF 15-21% 比 RE 更高（EE argument structure 更复杂），沿用 RE 的 CF tradeoff framing\n143\t\n144\t**Story upgrade**: WikiEvents results confirm paper narrative: \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework applicable to any IE task with formal type constraints\". Three evidence lines: (1) EV/RoV→0% across all models, (2) grammar-only ablation proves two-layer necessity, (3) post-hoc filtering is non-viable for EE. This is the key differentiator for conference main vs Findings.\n145\t\n146\t**70B scale experiment** (P029-P030, in progress): Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC + DocRED to demonstrate scale generalization. If successful, adds a 4th model to cross-model evidence, strengthening C5.\n147\t\n148\t**Remaining risk**:\n149\t- CF 15-21% higher than RE → continues CF tradeoff framing\n150\t- 70B experiment timeline tight (need results by May 20 for paper integration)\n151\t\n152\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n153\t\n154\t### C1: \"5.78% is barely above 5% — threshold is arbitrary\"\n155\t**Response**: Don't argue about the threshold. Argue about per-relation distribution: Compare (27.6%), Evaluate-for (29.9%), Feature-of (11.3%) have double-digit violation rates with schema-informed prompt. The value proposition is per-relation guaranteed compliance, not overall statistical rate.\n156\t\n157\t### C2: \"Why not just post-hoc filter?\"\n158\t**Response (D013, 实验结果已出)**:\n159\t\n160\tPost-hoc filtering 实验结果：post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1（SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.24）——因 low F1 regime 下移除 FP 大幅提升 precision。\n161\t\n162\t**论文 framing（不以 F1 论高低，多维对比）**:\n163\t1. **Recall 维度（核心论点）**: OntoCoDec recall 上升 (SciERC +0.20pp, DocRED +0.56pp) = 概率质量重分配到合法 token 生效。Post-hoc recall 下降 (SciERC -0.72pp, DocRED -1.06pp) = 正确 triple 被误删。\n164\t2. **Information coverage**: DocRED post-hoc 丢弃 **48.1%** triples（近半数信息丢失），SciERC 16.8%。OntoCoDec 保留全部 triple slots。\n165\t3. **Operational**: OntoCoDec 产出即合规、无需后处理、支持流式。Post-hoc 需额外管线、不适用实时场景。\n166\t4. **Precision trade-off（诚实承认）**: \"Post-hoc achieves higher precision by removing a large fraction of triples, many of which are incorrect. This trades information coverage for precision — valid when FP are costly, but inadequate when completeness matters.\"\n167\t\n168\t数据表：SciERC post-hoc rejection 16.8%, OntoCoDec recall 11.60 vs post-hoc 10.68; DocRED post-hoc rejection 48.1%, OntoCoDec recall 10.02 vs post-hoc 8.40。\n169\t\n170\t**Reviewer 补充发现（D013 后）**:\n171\t5. **ET 残余**：post-hoc 只删 triples 不改 entity list，残余 ET=0.4% (SciERC) / 2.47% (DocRED)。OntoCoDec ET=0%。Post-hoc 无法解决 entity type 违规。\n172\t6. **127 个被删 TP (DocRED)**：过滤前 TP=1137，过滤后 TP=1010。丢失的 127 个 TP（11.2%）是正确提取但 entity type 违规的 triple。OntoCoDec 通过生成时强制合法 type 保留这些 TP——\"prevent vs detect\" 核心论据的具体数据。\n173\t7. **OntoCoDec+post-hoc 组合**（future work idea）：先 constrain 再 filter 残余 DR。低优先级，May 19 前不做。\n174\t\n175\t### C3: \"Bitwise AND of two masks is not novel\"\n176\t**Response**: The novelty is not the AND operation — it's (a) the automatic compilation from ontology definitions (zero-code schema compliance), (b) the stateful entity registry enabling cross-field constraints during autoregressive generation, (c) the decidability taxonomy providing theoretical guidance, and (d) the systematic violation landscape measurement motivating the approach.\n177\t\n178\t### C4: \"Evaluate-for violation rate increases with schema-informed prompt\"\n179\t**Response (prior-constraint conflict framework)**: Evaluate-for has 23/36 valid pairs; Method→Task is invalid for Evaluate-for but natural in the LLM's distributional prior (\"Method X evaluates for Task Y\" is semantically plausible). Schema-informed prompting creates a **prior-constraint conflict**: the model learns to avoid Method→Task for Evaluate-for (reducing count 133→87, -34.6%), but the remaining instances are harder boundary cases where the model's type assignment strategy becomes less stable. This is not just \"harder instances\" — it's an active interference between prompt-level constraint signals and the model's learned type associations.\n180\t\n181\t**This strengthens the paper's claim**: prompt-level intervention is not merely insufficient but potentially **counterproductive** for specific constraint configurations. Decoding-time enforcement avoids this issue entirely — it operates on logits, not on the model's reasoning process, so there is no prior-constraint conflict.\n182\t\n183\t### C5: \"Only tested on one model (Qwen3-8B)\"\n184\t**Response**: Cross-model validation DONE (D016 bootstrap verified). Llama-3.1-8B 零代码修改：\n185\t- SciERC: DR 13.34%→0.08% (↓99.4%), R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS\n186\t- DocRED: DR 26.07%→2.55% (↓90.2%), R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013, significant), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022, modest decline)\n187\t- Parse failures: unconstrained 68 vs full_s1 91 (6.8% vs 9.1%)\n188\t\n189\t**Cross-model claim 指导（Reviewer 专项评估）**:\n190\t- ✅ 可声明：\"OntoCoDec generalizes across model families without code modification\"（程序性事实，铁证）\n191\t- ❌ 不可声明：\"consistently achieves the same reduction rate\"（仅 2 模型，不足以量化声明）\n192\t- **RV↓DR↑ 正交性 finding**: Llama RV baseline 低(16%) 但 DR baseline 高(26%)，反向于 Qwen。证明两层约束解决正交 failure modes——vocabulary compliance ≠ semantic compliance。应作为 §5 cross-model 独立 finding 展开。\n193\t- **Parse failure 偏差**: checker skip parse failures (不计入 F1)，Llama 68/998=6.8% vs Qwen 12/998=1.2%。偏差方向保守（不利于 constrained），不威胁 claim。但需 footnote 披露 + cross-model 表增加 parse failure rate 行。\n194\t- **Llama SciERC CF=6.56%**: 比 Qwen 同量级更高，non-local constraint 问题在 Llama 上更突出，limitations 提及。\n195\t- 等 llama_docred_full_s1 出来后定最终 claim 措辞。\n196\t\n197\t### C6: \"Constrained decoding degrades generation quality (CRANE, Structure Snowballing)\"\n198\t**Response**: OntoCoDec's semantic constraints are narrower than full grammar constraints — only type tokens are masked, free text is unconstrained. **Bootstrap CI (10000×, D012 Qwen + D016 Llama, all registry-aligned)**:\n199\t\n200\t**Qwen3-8B**: SciERC R-F1 +0.13pp (p=0.58, NS), E-F1 -0.03pp (NS). DocRED R-F1 +0.50pp (p<0.001), E-F1 +1.23pp (p<0.001).\n201\t**Llama-3.1-8B**: SciERC R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS. DocRED R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022).\n202\t\n203\t**Cross-model pattern**: DocRED R-F1 显著提升（两个模型）。E-F1 model-dependent（Qwen +1.23pp, Llama -0.64pp）。\n204\t- 机制：grammar 消除 OOV relation names + 非标 entity types → all_set 方法下减少 FP → precision 提升。Grammar 是 F1 提升的唯一来源（grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37%, Δ=0.01pp, p=0.66）。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献。\n205\t- Frame as: \"On DocRED, R-F1 gains are significant for both models. Entity F1 impact is model-dependent.\"\n206\t- 不升级为 core claim，但如实报告。\n207\t\n208\t### C7: \"Your method trades DR violations for CF violations (cross-field consistency)\"\n209\t**Response**: Both S1 and S2 show elevated CF (per-triple rate ~8-10%). This is an inherent limitation of per-relation independent type enforcement. Must be proactively reported as a limitation. Defense:\n210\t\n211\t**CF 子类型分析（根因已确认）**：\n212\t- **EVR（entity-vs-relation type drift）**: 占 CF 的 >90%。同一 entity 在 entity list 和 relation triple 中被赋予不同 type。S1: 245 entities (7.34%), S2: 178 entities (5.54%, -27%)\n213\t- **Within-rel（同 entity 跨 relation type 不一致）**: S1: 10 (0.36%), S2: 18 (0.72%)\n214\t- S2 减少 EVR 但增加 within-rel——trade-off 更复杂，不是单纯好/差\n215\t\n216\t**Top 冲突模式**: Generic↔OtherScientificTerm (60次), Material↔OtherScientificTerm (28次), Material↔Method (20次)。**这些是 SciERC type system 固有的语义边界模糊区**——同一术语在不同学术语境下确实可以被合理归类为不同 type。CF 在相当程度上是 type system 模糊性的体现，非纯粹的方法缺陷。\n217\t\n218\t**论证层次**：\n219\t1. DR violations = structurally invalid triples（下游系统不可用）→ hard constraint\n220\t2. CF violations = same entity gets different types across relations → individual triples remain type-valid, only cross-triple consistency broken → soft preference\n221\t3. CF 的根因是 type system 语义边界模糊 + per-relation 独立 enforcement，非 bug\n222\t4. Future work: cross-relation global consistency pass (entity-level type consensus before relation-specific enforcement)\n223\t\n224\t**机制归因（口径对账确认）**：grammar_only CF=0.08%（与 unconstrained 持平），full_s1 CF=9.90%，full_s2 CF=8.03%。**CF 100% 由 semantic 层引入，grammar 层无贡献。** 这为 \"CF 是 semantic type enforcement 的系统性副作用\" 提供干净的消融证据。\n225\t\n226\t**论文数字口径**：CF rate 用 violation_checker 口径（denominator=total_entities，与 DR/RV/ET 一致）。分析段落额外给 entity-level EVR 率 + 受影响样本比例。注意：analyze_cf 脚本的 EVR/WR 两维度不是独立的（WR⊂EVR），论文中不要作为两个独立维度报告。\n227\t\n228\t**Do NOT hide this data.** Proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis + type ambiguity evidence + 消融归因 = 最强防御策略。\n229\t\n230\t### C8: \"Absolute F1 is too low (~8%) — results are not meaningful\"\n231\t**Response**: This is a zero-shot extraction setting (no training data, no fine-tuning). Low F1 is expected — supervised SOTA on SciERC relation F1 is ~40-50%. Our contribution is the constraint enforcement method, not extraction quality. F1 is a control variable verifying constraints don't degrade quality, not an optimization target. Recommended framing: \"We evaluate in a zero-shot setting to demonstrate that our constraint enforcement method works without task-specific training. F1 is reported to verify that constraint enforcement does not degrade extraction quality, not as a claim of state-of-the-art performance.\"\n232\t\n233\t## Paper Structure (Draft — D040 updated)\n234\t1. Introduction: Ontology constraint violations in LLM-based structured generation + composable framework overview (story: not just RE, general ontology-constrained generation)\n235\t2. Background: Grammar-constrained decoding (XGrammar) + IE ontology structure\n236\t3. Violation Landscape Study (Phase 0 empirics — independent contribution)\n237\t4. OntoCoDec Framework: Compiler + TypeConstraintProcessor + S1/S2 strategies\n238\t5. Experiments:\n239\t   - §5.1-5.3: RE experiments (SciERC + DocRED, 3 models, constrained vs unconstrained vs post-hoc vs prompt-based)\n240\t   - §5.4: **Event Extraction (WikiEvents)** — cross-task generalization (D040)\n241\t   - §5.5: Ablation + analysis (composability, latency, beam search, etc.)\n242\t6. Related Work: 5 constraint paradigms (grammar, vocabulary, structural, type-checking, ontology) + event extraction methods\n243\t7. Conclusion: Framework generality across IE tasks\n244\t\n245\t## Claim Calibration (per Reviewer assessment)\n246\t\n247\t**Safe to claim (sufficient evidence from Phase 2)**:\n248\t- \"First systematic study of ontology constraint violations in LLM-based IE\"\n249\t- \"Violation rate correlates with constraint tightness, not ontology size\" (D014: DR reduction ceiling 由 tightness × model RV baseline 共同决定)\n250\t- \"Grammar+semantic constrained decoding eliminates 94% of DR violations at zero F1 cost\" ✅ Phase 2 confirmed\n251\t- \"Two-layer architecture provides complementary coverage — grammar enables semantic\" ✅ Ablation confirmed\n252\t- \"Prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity\" ✅ SciERC ↓62% vs DocRED ↓32%\n253\t\n254\t**Claim with caution**:\n255\t- \"Near-complete type-valid IE\" — S1 0.93%, S2 0.97% residual, not truly 0%. Title updated to \"Near-Complete\"\n256\t- \"Principled framework applicable to arbitrary IE ontologies\" — RE validated on 2 datasets × 2 models; EE (WikiEvents) 10-doc preliminary shows ↓95.8% semantic violations, full results pending\n257\t- \"F1 improvement\" — SciERC: not significant (p=0.58), frame as F1-neutral; DocRED: significant (+0.50pp, p<0.001), 可报告但不升级为 core claim，归因于 OOV elimination 而非约束解码本身的提升\n258\t- \"CF reveals type system ambiguity\" — 可在 §5.3 作为 analysis finding 展开（Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 等模式有独立 insight 价值），但 §7 必须同时保留 CF 作为 limitation + future work。**两处都要有，缺一不可。** 不能暗示\"因为是 type ambiguity 所以 CF 可接受\"\n259\t\n260\t**Do NOT claim**:\n261\t- \"General infrastructure for IE\" — only zero-shot extraction validated\n262\t- \"State-of-the-art\" — F1 is control variable, not optimization target (see C8)\n263\t- \"Synergistic effect\" — mechanism is enabling dependency, not mutual amplification (see Claim 3)\n264\t- \"S2 solves CF\" or \"S2 mitigates Structure Snowballing\" — data shows S2 ≈ S1 on all metrics; position as architectural variant only\n265\t- \"Pilot50 DR=0%\" — small-sample artifact, full S2 has DR=0.97%\n266\t- \"Grammar-first invariant\" 作为独立 claim — 证据不足（仅 1 次崩溃触发，实现是 fallback 非形式化保证）。写入 §4 方法论设计原则（1-2 句），不升级为 claim\n267\t- \"Robust dual-layer composition across schema complexities\" — 等 DocRED 完成。最终如 fallback ≤5/998，可写经验性陈述，不做泛化 claim\n268\t\n269\t## Risk Ranking (ordered by reject probability)\n270\t\n271\t1. **CF violation trade-off under-addressed** (MEDIUM-HIGH): S1 9.9%, S2 8.03% — both elevated. **S2 confirmed: does NOT solve CF.** This is the #1 attack surface. Mitigated by proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis (C7). Must be reported as explicit limitation with future work direction (global entity-type consensus).\n272\t2. ~~**Single model limitation**~~ (RESOLVED): Llama-3.1-8B SciERC ✅ (DR↓99.4%) + DocRED ✅ (DR↓90.2%). 2 模型 × 2 数据集全矩阵完成。\n273\t3. **Novelty perception** (MEDIUM): \"PLDI'25 for code → OntoCoDec for IE\" attack line. Must argue IE constraint structure differs fundamentally.\n274\t4. ~~**DocRED Phase 2 weak**~~ (RESOLVED → reframed as D014): Qwen DR↓44.7%, Llama DR↓90.2% — both substantial. Weaker Qwen reduction explained by RV baseline interaction (D014), not method failure.\n275\t5. ~~**Phase 2 F1 drop**~~ (RESOLVED): F1 confirmed neutral (SciERC) or positive (DocRED, p<0.001). Bootstrap CI D012 confirms. No longer a risk.\n276\t\n277\t## Critical Path to EMNLP Submission (May 25)\n278\t\n279\t- **May 13-14**: Phase 0 + Phase 1 + Phase 2 SciERC ✅\n280\t- **May 14**: Phase 2 DocRED 4-way ablation ✅ + Llama SciERC cross-model ✅ + Dream 完成 (3/6)\n281\t- **May 14-15**: Llama DocRED ✅ + Checker 修正 ✅ + post-hoc ✅ + bootstrap CI ✅ + related work ✅\n282\t- **May 15-17**: Prompt sensitivity ✅ + WikiEvents pipeline 开发 + continuation v2 突破\n283\t- **May 17-18**: WikiEvents 3 模型 unconstrained baselines (进行中) + constrained 全量\n284\t- **May 18-19**: WikiEvents 结果分析 + §5.4 Event Extraction 章节撰写\n285\t- **May 19-20**: Intro/Abstract/Conclusion 升级（cross-task story）+ 内部稿 → submit_paper_to_review\n286\t- **May 20-24**: Review 修改 + 最终提交\n287\t\n288\t**当前瓶颈**: WikiEvents 全量实验完成是关键路径。3 模型 unconstrained baselines 并行进行中（Qwen ~68/246, Mistral ~31/246, Llama 重启中），constrained 实验随后立即启动。\n289\t\n290\t## Status\n291\t- Phase 0 SciERC: ✅ Complete (minimal + schema-informed)\n292\t- Phase 0 DocRED: ✅ Complete (minimal 18.7% DR + schema-informed 12.8% DR)\n293\t- Phase 1 Compiler: ✅ Complete (grammar + semantic layers integrated)\n294\t- Phase 2 SciERC (5 configs): ✅ Complete (S1 DR↓94% F1-neutral, S2 降级为 ablation)\n295\t- Phase 2 DocRED (4 configs): ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓45%, grammar ET/RV→0%)\n296\t- Llama SciERC cross-model: ✅ Complete (DR↓99.4%, F1-neutral, 零代码修改)\n297\t- Llama DocRED cross-model: ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓90.2%, unconstrained DR=26.07%)\n298\t- Checker v2 (D011): ✅ Fixed (ET triple-counting → unique entity dedup)\n299\t- Bootstrap CI (D012): ✅ Fixed + confirmed (entity filter bug resolved)\n300\t- Post-hoc baseline (D013): ✅ Complete (multi-dimensional framing)\n301\t- Related work: ✅ 42 bib entries, 4 additions merged\n302\t- Dream 6/6 actions: ✅ All complete\n303\t- CF violation analysis: ✅ Confirmed inherent limitation (S1 9.9% SciERC / 2.57% DocRED / 12.02% Llama DocRED)\n304\t- D014 tightness revision: ✅ Complete (tightness × RV baseline dual-factor)\n305\t- Llama bootstrap CI (D016): ✅ Fixed + verified (registry-aligned ≤0.05pp, all p-values in paper)\n306\t- Paper compilation: ✅ 8 pages正文 + appendix\n307\t- R5 text fixes (N1/N2/N3/W1-W6): ✅ All complete and verified\n308\t- Prompt sensitivity analysis: ✅ Complete (3 prompts × 2 modes, DR reduction 94.0-94.6%, σ=0.3pp; appendix written)\n309\t- Doc length breakdown: ✅ Complete (appendix written)\n310\t- **WikiEvents Event Extraction (D040)**: 🔄 Continuation v2 突破 (10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic ↓95.8%); 3 模型 unconstrained baselines 进行中; constrained 全量待启动\n311\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a8bb760-f9b6-4261-9b0b-0d876b9983da","uuid":"b64775c6-4c9f-4bba-a663-59910e1cf074","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:08:51.510Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T052642/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# OntoCoDec — Paper Framing\n\n## Target Venue\nEMNLP 2026 (ARR submission May 25, 2026) — **目标: conference main**（D040, 用户明确指示）\n\n## Title\nOntoCoDec: Type-Valid Information Extraction via Compiled Ontology Constraints\n(D015: \"Near-Complete\" dropped — DocRED residual DR=10.21% (Qwen) 不算 near-complete。论文贡献是方法，不是特定消除率。SciERC 0.93% 和 DocRED 2.55% (Llama) 可在正文中描述为 near-complete，但 title 不宜 overclaim。)\n\n**D040 Story 升级方向**: 从 \"IE-specific constrained decoding\" → \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework\"。WikiEvents Event Extraction 验证跨任务泛化。Continuation masking v2 突破（10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic violations ↓95.8%）初步确认跨任务有效性，全量实验进行中。最终 title 待全量结果后调整。\n\n## Core Insight\nLLM-based IE systems produce systematic ontology constraint violations concentrated in specific relation types. Prompt-level intervention (schema-informed prompting) reduces violations by ~62% but cannot eliminate them — certain relation types retain 25-30% violation rates even with explicit constraint descriptions. OntoCoDec provides **near-complete elimination (DR 15.4%→0.93%, ↓94%) at zero or positive F1 impact** through automatic ontology-to-decoder constraint compilation with two complementary layers.\n\n**Phase 2 confirmed (D012 bootstrap CI, v2 fix)**: Grammar+Semantic dual-layer constrained decoding reduces domain/range violations by 94%, eliminates entity-type and relation-vocabulary violations entirely (→0%). F1 impact is **dataset-dependent**:\n- SciERC: Rel F1 neutral (+0.13pp, p=0.58), Ent F1 neutral (-0.03pp, p=0.53)\n- DocRED: Rel F1 **significantly improved** (+0.50pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.23, +0.81]); Ent F1 **significantly improved** (+1.23pp, p<0.001, 95% CI [+0.94, +1.55])\n- Mechanism: grammar 消除 OOV relation names (DocRED RV 29.66%→0.03%) + 非标 entity types (ET 2.48%→0%)。all_set F1 方法下 OOV=FP → fewer FP → higher precision/F1。SciERC baseline RV/ET 已很低，效果不显著。\n- **Grammar 层是 F1 提升的唯一来源**: grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37% (Δ+0.01pp, p=0.66)。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献，专注 DR reduction。\n\n## Core Claims\n\n### Claim 1 (Empirical): Violation Landscape\nLLM-based IE systems violate ontology type constraints at non-trivial rates (15.4% per-triple on SciERC, 18.7% on DocRED). Violations are **not uniformly distributed** — they concentrate on relation types with tight domain/range constraints (Feature-of 33.5%, Compare 42.4%) while loose-constraint relations show near-zero violation (Used-for 0.8%).\n\n**Key insight**: Violation rate is driven by **constraint tightness**, not ontology size. A small ontology with tight constraints can produce more violations than a large ontology with loose constraints.\n\n**D014 修订**: DR reduction ceiling 由 **tightness × model RV baseline** 共同决定，非 tightness 单因素。Llama DocRED DR↓90.2% vs Qwen DR↓44.7%（同一 ontology τ̄=0.842）。机制：Qwen RV=29.66% >> Llama RV=16.03% → grammar 层将 OOV triples 强制匹配有效关系名 → 揭露大量 latent DR violations → 残余 DR 更高。这是比单一 tightness 更深的 insight。\n\n**Evidence**: SciERC (7 relations) 15.4%; DocRED (96 relations) 18.7% — comparable rates despite 14× ontology size difference. Schema-informed prompt on DocRED only achieves DR↓32% (vs SciERC ↓62%), confirming **prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity**.\n\n### Claim 2 (Empirical): Prompt Insufficiency\nSchema-informed prompting (explicitly describing domain/range constraints in the prompt) reduces but does not eliminate violations:\n- Overall: 15.4% → 5.78% (-62.4%), still above 5%\n- Per-relation: Compare 42.4% → 27.6%, Evaluate-for 24.1% → 29.9% (**worse**)\n- Prompt intervention is unreliable at the per-relation level — some relations improve, one regresses\n\n**Narrative**: This is NOT about \"5.78% barely above 5%\". The story is: **prompt-level intervention is fundamentally unreliable as a guarantee mechanism**. It works statistically but cannot provide per-instance compliance. Three specific relation types retain >10% violation rates with schema-informed prompts. For safety-critical IE (biomedical, legal, regulatory), statistical reduction is insufficient — guaranteed compliance is required.\n\n### Claim 3 (Methodological): Composable Constraint Framework\nOntoCoDec automatically compiles IE ontology schemas into two composable constraint layers:\n1. **Grammar layer** (XGrammar): JSON structure + type vocabulary constraints (CFG-expressible)\n2. **Semantic layer** (TypeConstraintProcessor): Cross-field domain/range constraints via stateful entity registry + dynamic logit masking\n\nThe two layers are **complementary with enabling dependency**: grammar ensures every generated relation type is in the valid vocabulary, which enables the semantic layer to look up and enforce domain/range rules for that type. Without grammar, the semantic layer encounters unknown relation types and cannot enforce constraints (explaining why semantic_only achieves only ↓24% vs full_s1 ↓94%). This is NOT \"synergistic\" (mutual amplification) — grammar is a prerequisite for semantic, not vice versa.\n\nThe two layers compose via bitwise AND of token masks. Recommended framing: \"Grammar and semantic constraints compose via bitwise AND with an enabling dependency: grammar ensures structural validity, enabling semantic constraints to enforce domain/range rules. When constraint tightness creates empty intersection between layers, the system degrades gracefully to grammar-only constraints, maintaining structural validity as a guaranteed floor.\"\n\n**Graceful degradation + Fallback 频率量化** (D008 + Reviewer 发现):\nWhen $M_{semantic} \\cap M_{grammar} = \\emptyset$, the system falls back to grammar-only control.\n\n**关键量化数据（Reviewer 从日志挖掘）**:\n- Llama DocRED full_s1: **32,921 次 fallback / 577 docs = ~57 次/doc**\n- Llama SciERC full_s1: **5,882 次 fallback / 550 docs = ~10.7 次/doc**\n- DocRED fallback 频率是 SciERC 的 **5.3×**\n- Qwen DocRED fallback 率未知（日志当时无 fallback logging，需估算）\n\n**这直接解释了 DocRED DR 残余 10.19% vs SciERC 0.93%**: 更多 token 位置退化为 grammar-only → grammar-only 的 DR 已知为 26.17% → 高 fallback = 高残余 DR。\n\n**论文建议**: 在 §5 tightness 段报告 fallback 率，定义 \"Constraint Coverage\" 指标（semantic masking 实际生效的 token 比例）。这把 \"10.19% DR 残余\" 从弱点变成可量化分析的 finding。Frame as \"engineering robustness\" in §4; fallback 频率 + tightness 作为 §5 定量分析。\n\n**Decidability taxonomy**: Constraints classified by prefix-decidability:\n- (a) Purely local: entity type ∈ vocabulary (grammar layer)\n- (b) Prefix-decidable with state: relation argument types compatible with domain/range (semantic layer, requires entity registry)\n- (c) Truly non-local: forward coreference — out of scope for forward-only decoding\n\n### Claim 4 (Methodological): S1 vs S2 Decoding Strategies — Architectural Ablation\n- S1 (single-pass): Both layers applied throughout generation. **Recommended primary strategy** — simpler, slightly better metrics across the board.\n- S2 (two-pass): Pass 1 extracts entities (grammar-only), Pass 2 generates relations with input-dependent grammar compiled from Pass 1 entities.\n\n**S2 full results (551/551 SciERC)**: DR 0.97% (vs S1 0.93%), CF 8.03% (vs S1 9.9%), R-F1 8.03% (vs S1 8.36%). S2 does NOT solve CF — the 1.87pp reduction is not significant. S2 also slightly worse on DR and F1. **S2 is an architectural variant demonstrating framework flexibility, not a CF solution.** Position in paper as ablation (Section 5 or Appendix), not as a core contribution.\n\n⚠️ **Do NOT cite pilot50 DR=0% as S2 evidence** — small-sample artifact; full run shows DR=0.97%. Per-relation S2 DR is worse than S1 on Compare (4.6% vs 2.82%), Part-of (1.25% vs 0%), Used-for (0.12% vs 0%).\n\n### Claim 5 (Empirical): Cross-Task Generalization — Event Extraction (D040, NEW)\n**Status**: ✅ All 3 models × 246 docs complete (v3 with collision fix + exact-match fix)\n\nOntoCoDec generalizes beyond Relation Extraction to **Event Extraction** (WikiEvents, Li et al. NAACL 2021), demonstrating that the framework is task-agnostic for any IE task with ontology-defined type constraints.\n\n**Cross-task framing (Reviewer 评估 confirmed)**:\n- **RoV 是 DR 的正确对应物**（不是 RV）：EE 中 per-type violation rate 是 RE 的 3-5×，支持 \"more complex ontology → more critical constraint enforcement\" claim\n- **三层级联 Grammar→RoV→AC**（比 RE 的 Grammar→DR 两层更丰富）：grammar 消除 EV，使 semantic layer 可以 enforce role restriction (RoV→0%)，进而暴露 AC violations。这强化 architecture contribution 论证。\n- **Semantic layer 是 EE 的唯一防线**：grammar 层对 role vocabulary 无能力，只有 semantic layer + continuation masking 能 enforce per-event-type role constraints\n- **\"Practical value\" 防线**：Arg F1 ≈ 0% 不削弱 claim，因为 (a) mechanism generalization 是 contribution 不是 SOTA performance，(b) FT composability 已在 RE 中证明 high-F1 场景有效\n\n**WikiEvents specifics** (DARPA KAIROS ontology):\n- 56 event types × 80 argument roles × 27 entity types（含 5 个补充 Contact 子类型 + CRM entity type）\n- 245 组显式 (event_type, role) → allowed_entity_types 约束\n- Maps directly to OntoCoDec's semantic layer: argument role type constraints ≡ domain/range constraints\n- 27 entity types（比 ACE05 的 7 个更丰富）→ constraint space 更大，更能展示 semantic layer 价值\n- 99.98% 数据满足约束 → 约束定义是真实有效的\n- Hierarchical event names (e.g., Conflict.Attack.DetonateExplode) → 扁平化为 leaf-node 解决 first-token collision（96.1%→3.9%）\n\n**数据集选择理由**（MAVEN/RAMS 排除）：\n- MAVEN (168 types): 无 argument extraction，不适用\n- MAVEN-Arg (162 types): FrameNet-based，无 role→entity_type schema 约束\n- RAMS (139 types): 仅 cardinality 约束，无 entity type binding\n- ACE05 (33 types): LDC 付费，采购周期来不及\n- **WikiEvents 是唯一同时满足 \"免费 + 有显式 role→entity_type 约束\" 的数据集**\n\n**Violation 分类** (5 类，从 RE 的 4 类扩展):\n- ET (Entity Type): entity type 不在 ontology 合法类型列表中\n- EV (Event Vocabulary): event type 不在 ontology 定义中\n- RoV (Role Vocabulary): argument role 不在该 event type 定义中\n- AC (Argument Constraint): argument entity type 不满足 role→entity_type 约束（DR 的自然推广）\n- CF (Cross-Field): 同一 entity 跨 event 被赋予不同 type\n\n**Full results (246 docs, v3 final — collision fix + exact-match fix)**:\n\n| Metric | Qwen3-8B uncon. | Qwen3-8B Full S1 | Llama-3.1-8B uncon. | Llama-3.1-8B Full S1 | Mistral-7B uncon. | Mistral-7B Full S1 |\n|--------|-----------------|-------------------|---------------------|----------------------|-------------------|---------------------|\n| Parse | 88.6% | 83.7% | 91.9% | 84.1% | 88.6% | 88.6% |\n| EV | 24.0% | **0%** | 10.5% | **0%** | 37.3% | **0%** |\n| RoV | 74.9% | **0%** | 88.8% | **0%** | 63.9% | **0%** |\n| AC | 0.3% | 2.1% | 0.1% | 3.8% | 0% | 1.3% |\n| CF | 0% | 21.1% | 0% | 17.2% | 0% | 14.9% |\n| Trigger F1 | 11.8% | 13.4% | 5.7% | 7.5% | 2.4% | 3.9% |\n| Ent F1 | 0% | 14.1% | 0% | 17.6% | 0% | 11.7% |\n\n**Grammar-only ablation (Mistral v3, all 3 models)**:\n- Grammar eliminates EV→0% but RoV remains 64-77%: grammar CFG cannot constrain 80 argument roles conditioned on event context\n- AC rises to 8-14% under grammar-only (latent violation surfacing pattern, same as DocRED RE)\n- Proves semantic layer is essential for EE: two-layer architecture is necessary, not just convenient\n\n**Post-hoc filtering comparison (devastating)**:\n- Qwen: 5,467→23 arguments (99.6% discarded) to reach 0% violation\n- Llama: 5,053→3 arguments (99.9% discarded)\n- Mistral: 6,034→0 arguments (100% discarded)\n- Post-hoc is not viable for EE (contrasts with RE where it's expensive but functional)\n\n**BPE collision diagnostic (confirmed 2026-05-18)**:\n- Qwen (BPE, ~152K vocab): **0 collision groups** — all 27 entity types have unique first tokens\n- Llama (BPE, ~128K vocab): **0 collision groups** — same\n- Mistral (SentencePiece, ~32K vocab): **2 collision groups** (SID/SEN/SIDE→'S', BAL/BOD→'B')\n- **Residual AC narrative**: Mistral AC 1.3% = residual after collision fix (was 16.6%); Qwen/Llama AC 2.1-3.8% = purely model semantic confusion (confuses similar entity types like SID vs SEN), NOT tokenizer collision\n\n**关键 findings**:\n- RoV 是压倒性违规（64-89%），远超 RE 的 RV（1-30%）→ 更强力展示 constraint 需求\n- EV 显著（10-37%）→ grammar 层直接消除\n- **Entity F1 从 0% 恢复到 11.7-17.6%**: 不是语义改进，是 format compliance 恢复——grammar enforcement 产生 schema-valid JSON，parser 才能识别 entity mentions\n- Trigger F1 +1.5 to +1.8pp: elimination of OOV event types counted as FP\n- CF 15-21% 比 RE 更高（EE argument structure 更复杂），沿用 RE 的 CF tradeoff framing\n\n**Story upgrade**: WikiEvents results confirm paper narrative: \"universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework applicable to any IE task with formal type constraints\". Three evidence lines: (1) EV/RoV→0% across all models, (2) grammar-only ablation proves two-layer necessity, (3) post-hoc filtering is non-viable for EE. This is the key differentiator for conference main vs Findings.\n\n**70B scale experiment** (P029-P030, in progress): Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC + DocRED to demonstrate scale generalization. If successful, adds a 4th model to cross-model evidence, strengthening C5.\n\n**Remaining risk**:\n- CF 15-21% higher than RE → continues CF tradeoff framing\n- 70B experiment timeline tight (need results by May 20 for paper integration)\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### C1: \"5.78% is barely above 5% — threshold is arbitrary\"\n**Response**: Don't argue about the threshold. Argue about per-relation distribution: Compare (27.6%), Evaluate-for (29.9%), Feature-of (11.3%) have double-digit violation rates with schema-informed prompt. The value proposition is per-relation guaranteed compliance, not overall statistical rate.\n\n### C2: \"Why not just post-hoc filter?\"\n**Response (D013, 实验结果已出)**:\n\nPost-hoc filtering 实验结果：post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1（SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.24）——因 low F1 regime 下移除 FP 大幅提升 precision。\n\n**论文 framing（不以 F1 论高低，多维对比）**:\n1. **Recall 维度（核心论点）**: OntoCoDec recall 上升 (SciERC +0.20pp, DocRED +0.56pp) = 概率质量重分配到合法 token 生效。Post-hoc recall 下降 (SciERC -0.72pp, DocRED -1.06pp) = 正确 triple 被误删。\n2. **Information coverage**: DocRED post-hoc 丢弃 **48.1%** triples（近半数信息丢失），SciERC 16.8%。OntoCoDec 保留全部 triple slots。\n3. **Operational**: OntoCoDec 产出即合规、无需后处理、支持流式。Post-hoc 需额外管线、不适用实时场景。\n4. **Precision trade-off（诚实承认）**: \"Post-hoc achieves higher precision by removing a large fraction of triples, many of which are incorrect. This trades information coverage for precision — valid when FP are costly, but inadequate when completeness matters.\"\n\n数据表：SciERC post-hoc rejection 16.8%, OntoCoDec recall 11.60 vs post-hoc 10.68; DocRED post-hoc rejection 48.1%, OntoCoDec recall 10.02 vs post-hoc 8.40。\n\n**Reviewer 补充发现（D013 后）**:\n5. **ET 残余**：post-hoc 只删 triples 不改 entity list，残余 ET=0.4% (SciERC) / 2.47% (DocRED)。OntoCoDec ET=0%。Post-hoc 无法解决 entity type 违规。\n6. **127 个被删 TP (DocRED)**：过滤前 TP=1137，过滤后 TP=1010。丢失的 127 个 TP（11.2%）是正确提取但 entity type 违规的 triple。OntoCoDec 通过生成时强制合法 type 保留这些 TP——\"prevent vs detect\" 核心论据的具体数据。\n7. **OntoCoDec+post-hoc 组合**（future work idea）：先 constrain 再 filter 残余 DR。低优先级，May 19 前不做。\n\n### C3: \"Bitwise AND of two masks is not novel\"\n**Response**: The novelty is not the AND operation — it's (a) the automatic compilation from ontology definitions (zero-code schema compliance), (b) the stateful entity registry enabling cross-field constraints during autoregressive generation, (c) the decidability taxonomy providing theoretical guidance, and (d) the systematic violation landscape measurement motivating the approach.\n\n### C4: \"Evaluate-for violation rate increases with schema-informed prompt\"\n**Response (prior-constraint conflict framework)**: Evaluate-for has 23/36 valid pairs; Method→Task is invalid for Evaluate-for but natural in the LLM's distributional prior (\"Method X evaluates for Task Y\" is semantically plausible). Schema-informed prompting creates a **prior-constraint conflict**: the model learns to avoid Method→Task for Evaluate-for (reducing count 133→87, -34.6%), but the remaining instances are harder boundary cases where the model's type assignment strategy becomes less stable. This is not just \"harder instances\" — it's an active interference between prompt-level constraint signals and the model's learned type associations.\n\n**This strengthens the paper's claim**: prompt-level intervention is not merely insufficient but potentially **counterproductive** for specific constraint configurations. Decoding-time enforcement avoids this issue entirely — it operates on logits, not on the model's reasoning process, so there is no prior-constraint conflict.\n\n### C5: \"Only tested on one model (Qwen3-8B)\"\n**Response**: Cross-model validation DONE (D016 bootstrap verified). Llama-3.1-8B 零代码修改：\n- SciERC: DR 13.34%→0.08% (↓99.4%), R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS\n- DocRED: DR 26.07%→2.55% (↓90.2%), R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013, significant), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022, modest decline)\n- Parse failures: unconstrained 68 vs full_s1 91 (6.8% vs 9.1%)\n\n**Cross-model claim 指导（Reviewer 专项评估）**:\n- ✅ 可声明：\"OntoCoDec generalizes across model families without code modification\"（程序性事实，铁证）\n- ❌ 不可声明：\"consistently achieves the same reduction rate\"（仅 2 模型，不足以量化声明）\n- **RV↓DR↑ 正交性 finding**: Llama RV baseline 低(16%) 但 DR baseline 高(26%)，反向于 Qwen。证明两层约束解决正交 failure modes——vocabulary compliance ≠ semantic compliance。应作为 §5 cross-model 独立 finding 展开。\n- **Parse failure 偏差**: checker skip parse failures (不计入 F1)，Llama 68/998=6.8% vs Qwen 12/998=1.2%。偏差方向保守（不利于 constrained），不威胁 claim。但需 footnote 披露 + cross-model 表增加 parse failure rate 行。\n- **Llama SciERC CF=6.56%**: 比 Qwen 同量级更高，non-local constraint 问题在 Llama 上更突出，limitations 提及。\n- 等 llama_docred_full_s1 出来后定最终 claim 措辞。\n\n### C6: \"Constrained decoding degrades generation quality (CRANE, Structure Snowballing)\"\n**Response**: OntoCoDec's semantic constraints are narrower than full grammar constraints — only type tokens are masked, free text is unconstrained. **Bootstrap CI (10000×, D012 Qwen + D016 Llama, all registry-aligned)**:\n\n**Qwen3-8B**: SciERC R-F1 +0.13pp (p=0.58, NS), E-F1 -0.03pp (NS). DocRED R-F1 +0.50pp (p<0.001), E-F1 +1.23pp (p<0.001).\n**Llama-3.1-8B**: SciERC R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011, negligible), E-F1 NS. DocRED R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013), E-F1 -0.64pp (p=0.022).\n\n**Cross-model pattern**: DocRED R-F1 显著提升（两个模型）。E-F1 model-dependent（Qwen +1.23pp, Llama -0.64pp）。\n- 机制：grammar 消除 OOV relation names + 非标 entity types → all_set 方法下减少 FP → precision 提升。Grammar 是 F1 提升的唯一来源（grammar_only Ent F1=59.38% ≈ full_s1 59.37%, Δ=0.01pp, p=0.66）。Semantic 层对 F1 无额外贡献。\n- Frame as: \"On DocRED, R-F1 gains are significant for both models. Entity F1 impact is model-dependent.\"\n- 不升级为 core claim，但如实报告。\n\n### C7: \"Your method trades DR violations for CF violations (cross-field consistency)\"\n**Response**: Both S1 and S2 show elevated CF (per-triple rate ~8-10%). This is an inherent limitation of per-relation independent type enforcement. Must be proactively reported as a limitation. Defense:\n\n**CF 子类型分析（根因已确认）**：\n- **EVR（entity-vs-relation type drift）**: 占 CF 的 >90%。同一 entity 在 entity list 和 relation triple 中被赋予不同 type。S1: 245 entities (7.34%), S2: 178 entities (5.54%, -27%)\n- **Within-rel（同 entity 跨 relation type 不一致）**: S1: 10 (0.36%), S2: 18 (0.72%)\n- S2 减少 EVR 但增加 within-rel——trade-off 更复杂，不是单纯好/差\n\n**Top 冲突模式**: Generic↔OtherScientificTerm (60次), Material↔OtherScientificTerm (28次), Material↔Method (20次)。**这些是 SciERC type system 固有的语义边界模糊区**——同一术语在不同学术语境下确实可以被合理归类为不同 type。CF 在相当程度上是 type system 模糊性的体现，非纯粹的方法缺陷。\n\n**论证层次**：\n1. DR violations = structurally invalid triples（下游系统不可用）→ hard constraint\n2. CF violations = same entity gets different types across relations → individual triples remain type-valid, only cross-triple consistency broken → soft preference\n3. CF 的根因是 type system 语义边界模糊 + per-relation 独立 enforcement，非 bug\n4. Future work: cross-relation global consistency pass (entity-level type consensus before relation-specific enforcement)\n\n**机制归因（口径对账确认）**：grammar_only CF=0.08%（与 unconstrained 持平），full_s1 CF=9.90%，full_s2 CF=8.03%。**CF 100% 由 semantic 层引入，grammar 层无贡献。** 这为 \"CF 是 semantic type enforcement 的系统性副作用\" 提供干净的消融证据。\n\n**论文数字口径**：CF rate 用 violation_checker 口径（denominator=total_entities，与 DR/RV/ET 一致）。分析段落额外给 entity-level EVR 率 + 受影响样本比例。注意：analyze_cf 脚本的 EVR/WR 两维度不是独立的（WR⊂EVR），论文中不要作为两个独立维度报告。\n\n**Do NOT hide this data.** Proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis + type ambiguity evidence + 消融归因 = 最强防御策略。\n\n### C8: \"Absolute F1 is too low (~8%) — results are not meaningful\"\n**Response**: This is a zero-shot extraction setting (no training data, no fine-tuning). Low F1 is expected — supervised SOTA on SciERC relation F1 is ~40-50%. Our contribution is the constraint enforcement method, not extraction quality. F1 is a control variable verifying constraints don't degrade quality, not an optimization target. Recommended framing: \"We evaluate in a zero-shot setting to demonstrate that our constraint enforcement method works without task-specific training. F1 is reported to verify that constraint enforcement does not degrade extraction quality, not as a claim of state-of-the-art performance.\"\n\n## Paper Structure (Draft — D040 updated)\n1. Introduction: Ontology constraint violations in LLM-based structured generation + composable framework overview (story: not just RE, general ontology-constrained generation)\n2. Background: Grammar-constrained decoding (XGrammar) + IE ontology structure\n3. Violation Landscape Study (Phase 0 empirics — independent contribution)\n4. OntoCoDec Framework: Compiler + TypeConstraintProcessor + S1/S2 strategies\n5. Experiments:\n   - §5.1-5.3: RE experiments (SciERC + DocRED, 3 models, constrained vs unconstrained vs post-hoc vs prompt-based)\n   - §5.4: **Event Extraction (WikiEvents)** — cross-task generalization (D040)\n   - §5.5: Ablation + analysis (composability, latency, beam search, etc.)\n6. Related Work: 5 constraint paradigms (grammar, vocabulary, structural, type-checking, ontology) + event extraction methods\n7. Conclusion: Framework generality across IE tasks\n\n## Claim Calibration (per Reviewer assessment)\n\n**Safe to claim (sufficient evidence from Phase 2)**:\n- \"First systematic study of ontology constraint violations in LLM-based IE\"\n- \"Violation rate correlates with constraint tightness, not ontology size\" (D014: DR reduction ceiling 由 tightness × model RV baseline 共同决定)\n- \"Grammar+semantic constrained decoding eliminates 94% of DR violations at zero F1 cost\" ✅ Phase 2 confirmed\n- \"Two-layer architecture provides complementary coverage — grammar enables semantic\" ✅ Ablation confirmed\n- \"Prompt-level intervention scales poorly with ontology complexity\" ✅ SciERC ↓62% vs DocRED ↓32%\n\n**Claim with caution**:\n- \"Near-complete type-valid IE\" — S1 0.93%, S2 0.97% residual, not truly 0%. Title updated to \"Near-Complete\"\n- \"Principled framework applicable to arbitrary IE ontologies\" — RE validated on 2 datasets × 2 models; EE (WikiEvents) 10-doc preliminary shows ↓95.8% semantic violations, full results pending\n- \"F1 improvement\" — SciERC: not significant (p=0.58), frame as F1-neutral; DocRED: significant (+0.50pp, p<0.001), 可报告但不升级为 core claim，归因于 OOV elimination 而非约束解码本身的提升\n- \"CF reveals type system ambiguity\" — 可在 §5.3 作为 analysis finding 展开（Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 等模式有独立 insight 价值），但 §7 必须同时保留 CF 作为 limitation + future work。**两处都要有，缺一不可。** 不能暗示\"因为是 type ambiguity 所以 CF 可接受\"\n\n**Do NOT claim**:\n- \"General infrastructure for IE\" — only zero-shot extraction validated\n- \"State-of-the-art\" — F1 is control variable, not optimization target (see C8)\n- \"Synergistic effect\" — mechanism is enabling dependency, not mutual amplification (see Claim 3)\n- \"S2 solves CF\" or \"S2 mitigates Structure Snowballing\" — data shows S2 ≈ S1 on all metrics; position as architectural variant only\n- \"Pilot50 DR=0%\" — small-sample artifact, full S2 has DR=0.97%\n- \"Grammar-first invariant\" 作为独立 claim — 证据不足（仅 1 次崩溃触发，实现是 fallback 非形式化保证）。写入 §4 方法论设计原则（1-2 句），不升级为 claim\n- \"Robust dual-layer composition across schema complexities\" — 等 DocRED 完成。最终如 fallback ≤5/998，可写经验性陈述，不做泛化 claim\n\n## Risk Ranking (ordered by reject probability)\n\n1. **CF violation trade-off under-addressed** (MEDIUM-HIGH): S1 9.9%, S2 8.03% — both elevated. **S2 confirmed: does NOT solve CF.** This is the #1 attack surface. Mitigated by proactive disclosure + severity distinction + root cause analysis (C7). Must be reported as explicit limitation with future work direction (global entity-type consensus).\n2. ~~**Single model limitation**~~ (RESOLVED): Llama-3.1-8B SciERC ✅ (DR↓99.4%) + DocRED ✅ (DR↓90.2%). 2 模型 × 2 数据集全矩阵完成。\n3. **Novelty perception** (MEDIUM): \"PLDI'25 for code → OntoCoDec for IE\" attack line. Must argue IE constraint structure differs fundamentally.\n4. ~~**DocRED Phase 2 weak**~~ (RESOLVED → reframed as D014): Qwen DR↓44.7%, Llama DR↓90.2% — both substantial. Weaker Qwen reduction explained by RV baseline interaction (D014), not method failure.\n5. ~~**Phase 2 F1 drop**~~ (RESOLVED): F1 confirmed neutral (SciERC) or positive (DocRED, p<0.001). Bootstrap CI D012 confirms. No longer a risk.\n\n## Critical Path to EMNLP Submission (May 25)\n\n- **May 13-14**: Phase 0 + Phase 1 + Phase 2 SciERC ✅\n- **May 14**: Phase 2 DocRED 4-way ablation ✅ + Llama SciERC cross-model ✅ + Dream 完成 (3/6)\n- **May 14-15**: Llama DocRED ✅ + Checker 修正 ✅ + post-hoc ✅ + bootstrap CI ✅ + related work ✅\n- **May 15-17**: Prompt sensitivity ✅ + WikiEvents pipeline 开发 + continuation v2 突破\n- **May 17-18**: WikiEvents 3 模型 unconstrained baselines (进行中) + constrained 全量\n- **May 18-19**: WikiEvents 结果分析 + §5.4 Event Extraction 章节撰写\n- **May 19-20**: Intro/Abstract/Conclusion 升级（cross-task story）+ 内部稿 → submit_paper_to_review\n- **May 20-24**: Review 修改 + 最终提交\n\n**当前瓶颈**: WikiEvents 全量实验完成是关键路径。3 模型 unconstrained baselines 并行进行中（Qwen ~68/246, Mistral ~31/246, Llama 重启中），constrained 实验随后立即启动。\n\n## Status\n- Phase 0 SciERC: ✅ Complete (minimal + schema-informed)\n- Phase 0 DocRED: ✅ Complete (minimal 18.7% DR + schema-informed 12.8% DR)\n- Phase 1 Compiler: ✅ Complete (grammar + semantic layers integrated)\n- Phase 2 SciERC (5 configs): ✅ Complete (S1 DR↓94% F1-neutral, S2 降级为 ablation)\n- Phase 2 DocRED (4 configs): ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓45%, grammar ET/RV→0%)\n- Llama SciERC cross-model: ✅ Complete (DR↓99.4%, F1-neutral, 零代码修改)\n- Llama DocRED cross-model: ✅ Complete (full_s1 DR↓90.2%, unconstrained DR=26.07%)\n- Checker v2 (D011): ✅ Fixed (ET triple-counting → unique entity dedup)\n- Bootstrap CI (D012): ✅ Fixed + confirmed (entity filter bug resolved)\n- Post-hoc baseline (D013): ✅ Complete (multi-dimensional framing)\n- Related work: ✅ 42 bib entries, 4 additions merged\n- Dream 6/6 actions: ✅ All complete\n- CF violation analysis: ✅ Confirmed inherent limitation (S1 9.9% SciERC / 2.57% DocRED / 12.02% Llama DocRED)\n- D014 tightness revision: ✅ Complete (tightness × RV baseline dual-factor)\n- Llama bootstrap CI (D016): ✅ Fixed + verified (registry-aligned ≤0.05pp, all p-values in paper)\n- Paper compilation: ✅ 8 pages正文 + appendix\n- R5 text fixes (N1/N2/N3/W1-W6): ✅ All complete and verified\n- Prompt sensitivity analysis: ✅ Complete (3 prompts × 2 modes, DR reduction 94.0-94.6%, σ=0.3pp; appendix written)\n- Doc length breakdown: ✅ Complete (appendix written)\n- **WikiEvents Event Extraction (D040)**: 🔄 Continuation v2 突破 (10-doc: RoV 0%, semantic ↓95.8%); 3 模型 unconstrained baselines 进行中; constrained 全量待启动\n","numLines":311,"startLine":1,"totalLines":311}}}
